(419231, 37655, 7263, '<td valign="top">Not very exciting, sorry.<br/> <br/>For what it''s worth, the boys left foot should be flat on teh floor. he is young enough to be supple enough to do that and it will imporve his game no end, and stop him topping the ball. The right arm shoudl eb tucked in a bit more, he is chicken winging a bit.<br/> <br/>Great shoudler turn though! Wish I had started thsi young ;)<br/> <br/>Good luck.<br/> <br/>JP<br/> <br/></td>', 'Not very exciting, sorry. For what it''s worth, the boys left foot should be flat on teh floor. he is young enough to be supple enough to do that and it will imporve his game no end, and stop him topping the ball. The right arm shoudl eb tucked in a bit more, he is chicken winging a bit. Great shoudler turn though! Wish I had started thsi young ;) Good luck. JP ', '2003-09-15 04:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
