(419379, 37635, 3102, '<td valign="top">Too bad Wake Forest lost this one, 16-10!  A well-done shot with an impressive zoom here.  I especially like the position of Gilbert Gardner (#16) as he tries to block it.</td>', 'Too bad Wake Forest lost this one, 16-10!  A well-done shot with an impressive zoom here.  I especially like the position of Gilbert Gardner (#16) as he tries to block it.', '2003-09-15 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(419383, 37697, 3102, '<td valign="top">Volleyball has to be one of the world''s greatest sports, purely based on the attire!  :)  I might have cropped this on a little tighter to include just the two people involved in the volley, but this is still a good action shot.</td>', 'Volleyball has to be one of the world''s greatest sports, purely based on the attire!  :)  I might have cropped this on a little tighter to include just the two people involved in the volley, but this is still a good action shot.', '2003-09-15 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(419384, 37812, 3102, '<td valign="top">This one has a lot of potential with all of the colors -- I may have just tried a little different angle.  This version seems just a bit tilted, for one thing.  I might have tried putting the camera right on the floor of the alley in the middle to give a little different perspective.</td>', 'This one has a lot of potential with all of the colors -- I may have just tried a little different angle.  This version seems just a bit tilted, for one thing.  I might have tried putting the camera right on the floor of the alley in the middle to give a little different perspective.', '2003-09-15 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(419385, 37745, 3569, '<td valign="top">Killer eyes.  Nice contrasts and interpretation.</td>', 'Killer eyes.  Nice contrasts and interpretation.', '2003-09-15 10:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(419386, 37801, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The blue sky, smoke and plane... greatness.</td>', 'Great shot.  The blue sky, smoke and plane... greatness.', '2003-09-15 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(419389, 37759, 10686, '<td valign="top">I always considered chess a game, but anyway... I like the lighting, it looks like it''s coming through textured glass. Nice. The overall image seems kind of jaggy, especially around the white pieces in the foreground.</td>', 'I always considered chess a game, but anyway... I like the lighting, it looks like it''s coming through textured glass. Nice. The overall image seems kind of jaggy, especially around the white pieces in the foreground.', '2003-09-15 10:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(419391, 37007, 3569, '<td valign="top">Framing action, great shot.</td>', 'Framing action, great shot.', '2003-09-15 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(419394, 37417, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the open foreground and the sense of space between the main subject and the kids playing. I think it might help to crop a bit more from the top, right about at the bottom of the deck railing. That would eliminate some of the busy detail in the background.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the open foreground and the sense of space between the main subject and the kids playing. I think it might help to crop a bit more from the top, right about at the bottom of the deck railing. That would eliminate some of the busy detail in the background.', '2003-09-15 10:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(419396, 37801, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. I wish the rest of the plane popped out bright like the rudder does.</td>', 'Great Shot. I wish the rest of the plane popped out bright like the rudder does.', '2003-09-15 10:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(419397, 37812, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but not much action....</td>', 'Good shot, but not much action....', '2003-09-15 10:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(419398, 37710, 10686, '<td valign="top">I really like the wide aspect ratio here.</td>', 'I really like the wide aspect ratio here.', '2003-09-15 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(419399, 37643, 3102, '<td valign="top">Apparently one of the FEW first downs of that one for Bowie!  Sorry they blew it to the tune of 36-6!  :)  Overall this turned out very nicely... the guy''s helmet is in great focus and you captured a good moment.  I may have tried cropping a little closer around the runner.  There''s a bit of stuff on the right in particular that doesn''t really add to the shot.  My only other suggestion would have been to try a faster shutter speed to eliminate some of the motion blur, but depending on the camera that''s not always an easy possibility.  Anyhow -- overall a great job!  Hopefully they''ll do better against McNeil this Friday :)</td>', 'Apparently one of the FEW first downs of that one for Bowie!  Sorry they blew it to the tune of 36-6!  :)  Overall this turned out very nicely... the guy''s helmet is in great focus and you captured a good moment.  I may have tried cropping a little closer around the runner.  There''s a bit of stuff on the right in particular that doesn''t really add to the shot.  My only other suggestion would have been to try a faster shutter speed to eliminate some of the motion blur, but depending on the camera that''s not always an easy possibility.  Anyhow -- overall a great job!  Hopefully they''ll do better against McNeil this Friday :)', '2003-09-15 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(419401, 37763, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the humor of it!  The ball is a bit too brightly exposed, though.</td>', 'I like the humor of it!  The ball is a bit too brightly exposed, though.', '2003-09-15 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(419402, 37580, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great action. Seeing the expressions on the face would have added dramatically. . . but I am sure you are aware of that.</td>', 'Great action. Seeing the expressions on the face would have added dramatically. . . but I am sure you are aware of that.', '2003-09-15 10:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(419403, 37558, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Very cute.  Were there cheerleaders, too...?  :)  I might have cropped this a little differently -- there seems to be a bit too much headroom.</td>', 'Ha!  Very cute.  Were there cheerleaders, too...?  :)  I might have cropped this a little differently -- there seems to be a bit too much headroom.', '2003-09-15 10:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(419406, 37635, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Would have liked to see a little more on the left and less right.</td>', 'Great action shot.  Would have liked to see a little more on the left and less right.', '2003-09-15 10:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(419407, 37200, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great sense of speed here, the white areas on the rear section of the car seem a bit hot. Still, that''s a minor thing</td>', 'Great sense of speed here, the white areas on the rear section of the car seem a bit hot. Still, that''s a minor thing', '2003-09-15 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(419408, 37835, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, I really like this</td>', 'Great DOF, I really like this', '2003-09-15 10:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(419409, 37576, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I have mixed feelings about the boat in the background.  It seems like the surfer gets a little jumbled in with the boat.  I like the perspective that the boat adds, but I probably would have liked it better had the boat been further on the left.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I have mixed feelings about the boat in the background.  It seems like the surfer gets a little jumbled in with the boat.  I like the perspective that the boat adds, but I probably would have liked it better had the boat been further on the left.', '2003-09-15 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(419410, 37558, 6667, '<td valign="top">Love it!  How long did he warm up before the action/!</td>', 'Love it!  How long did he warm up before the action/!', '2003-09-15 10:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(419412, 37330, 10686, '<td valign="top">I still say chess is a game and not a sport, but no matter.. I think this is a great picture. Might like to see a bit more of the board or a tighter crop on the right side.</td>', 'I still say chess is a game and not a sport, but no matter.. I think this is a great picture. Might like to see a bit more of the board or a tighter crop on the right side.', '2003-09-15 10:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(419413, 37783, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, I gotta admit this is... different!  I''m not sure I get the point of it, in all honesty though.  I''m also curious to know how this was done legally.</td>', 'Well, I gotta admit this is... different!  I''m not sure I get the point of it, in all honesty though.  I''m also curious to know how this was done legally.', '2003-09-15 10:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(419415, 37616, 10686, '<td valign="top">The umbrella makes this shot. Very nice!</td>', 'The umbrella makes this shot. Very nice!', '2003-09-15 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(419420, 37736, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the image is really what stands out. the fact that he''s close enough to see his face, even though it is slightly shadowed, is good. Compositionally it is appealing, although shame the entire wave break/splash wasnt in the frame. An excellent image and wonderful capture of sport action.</td>', 'The sharpness of the image is really what stands out. the fact that he''s close enough to see his face, even though it is slightly shadowed, is good. Compositionally it is appealing, although shame the entire wave break/splash wasnt in the frame. An excellent image and wonderful capture of sport action.', '2003-09-15 10:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(419422, 37852, 6667, '<td valign="top">Excellent all the way around. . . story , title, photo!</td>', 'Excellent all the way around. . . story , title, photo!', '2003-09-15 10:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419424, 37613, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great DOF here.</td>', 'Great DOF here.', '2003-09-15 10:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419426, 37613, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  A couple suggestions -- First, I may have tried lightening up the midtones just a little bit.  It seems like the girls'' heads get a little lost in the background.  I may have also cropped it just a little tighter -- the people in the background don''t really add a lot to the moment.  Still a nice job, though!</td>', 'Nicely done!  A couple suggestions -- First, I may have tried lightening up the midtones just a little bit.  It seems like the girls'' heads get a little lost in the background.  I may have also cropped it just a little tighter -- the people in the background don''t really add a lot to the moment.  Still a nice job, though!', '2003-09-15 10:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(419428, 37576, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wish the boat wasn''t there....Great shot otherwise</td>', 'Wish the boat wasn''t there....Great shot otherwise', '2003-09-15 10:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(419430, 37807, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sharpness is really what makes this stand out. It''s very clear, the capture of action is superb, and the composition works well. He''s in a position where it also makes you wonder if he''s going to take a nosedive into the water at any second. It tells a story but also makes you want to know what happened next. Something that a sports shot in a newspaper/magazine would encourage people to read in an accompanying article. Very nicely shot.</td>', 'The sharpness is really what makes this stand out. It''s very clear, the capture of action is superb, and the composition works well. He''s in a position where it also makes you wonder if he''s going to take a nosedive into the water at any second. It tells a story but also makes you want to know what happened next. Something that a sports shot in a newspaper/magazine would encourage people to read in an accompanying article. Very nicely shot.', '2003-09-15 10:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(419433, 37802, 10686, '<td valign="top">I thought this was football!! Anyway, GREAT action shot</td>', 'I thought this was football!! Anyway, GREAT action shot', '2003-09-15 10:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(419435, 37835, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  I like the crop, although I can''t decide whether I would have liked it more without the girl in the background -- it might have been better to crop a little lower since she''s not an intregal part of the play.</td>', 'Nice work!  I like the crop, although I can''t decide whether I would have liked it more without the girl in the background -- it might have been better to crop a little lower since she''s not an intregal part of the play.', '2003-09-15 10:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(419437, 37835, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Serious question though, do a lot of people show up to watch this sport ?<br/>My only comment on the photo is,  I wish the ball were in the shot. Everything else is right on.  One more question: Isn''t that a foul or something (on black)?</td>', 'Great action shot. Serious question though, do a lot of people show up to watch this sport ?My only comment on the photo is,  I wish the ball were in the shot. Everything else is right on.  One more question: Isn''t that a foul or something (on black)?', '2003-09-15 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(419438, 37007, 6008, '<td valign="top">I can understand your fear of people thinking it was posed but what a shame to do that to your title :( Anyways... the image itself is great! Very clear, compositionally good, the capture of action is superb. I especially like the expression on his face and the tension in his muscles. It certainly tells a story, although it looks like he safely made the catch. Another good thing (although it doesnt have any real merit) is that you have the perfect space at the top and on the left for a magazine title and blurb. I could see this on the cover of a magazine. Very nicely caught (pun intended!)</td>', 'I can understand your fear of people thinking it was posed but what a shame to do that to your title :( Anyways... the image itself is great! Very clear, compositionally good, the capture of action is superb. I especially like the expression on his face and the tension in his muscles. It certainly tells a story, although it looks like he safely made the catch. Another good thing (although it doesnt have any real merit) is that you have the perfect space at the top and on the left for a magazine title and blurb. I could see this on the cover of a magazine. Very nicely caught (pun intended!)', '2003-09-15 11:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(419441, 37238, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nylon string is showing.  And is that the shadow of two smiley eys?</td>', 'Nylon string is showing.  And is that the shadow of two smiley eys?', '2003-09-15 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(419444, 37634, 6008, '<td valign="top">The expression on their faces is great, although it''s the kid in the middle that really makes the shot. His facial expression and body language really tells the story, and it looks like it is going to hurt. I admit that the title does seem to help explain the shot a little, but standalone it is obvious what could be happening. The image itself is very clear, nicely sharp, vibrant, and a wonderful capture of action.</td>', 'The expression on their faces is great, although it''s the kid in the middle that really makes the shot. His facial expression and body language really tells the story, and it looks like it is going to hurt. I admit that the title does seem to help explain the shot a little, but standalone it is obvious what could be happening. The image itself is very clear, nicely sharp, vibrant, and a wonderful capture of action.', '2003-09-15 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(419446, 37655, 656, '<td valign="top">maybe this could have been framed with the ball more in the frame, rather than so tight up against the edge ?  The background seems really dark - mainly because of the sky that has crept in at the top.  You may have gotten a better result if you''d framed it without the sky in the frame at all ?</td>', 'maybe this could have been framed with the ball more in the frame, rather than so tight up against the edge ?  The background seems really dark - mainly because of the sky that has crept in at the top.  You may have gotten a better result if you''d framed it without the sky in the frame at all ?', '2003-09-15 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(419447, 37524, 9441, '<td valign="top">Now that is too cool!  Great job!</td>', 'Now that is too cool!  Great job!', '2003-09-15 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(419448, 37594, 9441, '<td valign="top">good originality....I like that....</td>', 'good originality....I like that....', '2003-09-15 11:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(419449, 37655, 6667, '<td valign="top">I hope that ball wasn''t coming your way!!!</td>', 'I hope that ball wasn''t coming your way!!!', '2003-09-15 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(419451, 37715, 656, '<td valign="top">a very different framing with all the grass.  I''m not entirely sure it works for me - makes me feel very removed from the action.</td>', 'a very different framing with all the grass.  I''m not entirely sure it works for me - makes me feel very removed from the action.', '2003-09-15 11:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(419452, 37769, 656, '<td valign="top">ever so slightly out of focus/ blurry / soft.  hard to tell which bit of the shot is actually in focus (or is it a crop?) but you''ve captured some action well.</td>', 'ever so slightly out of focus/ blurry / soft.  hard to tell which bit of the shot is actually in focus (or is it a crop?) but you''ve captured some action well.', '2003-09-15 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(419454, 37648, 656, '<td valign="top">good portrait sports shot.  Exposure seems a little bit hot (the legs and helment are over exposed) but other than that it is good - is his face really that orange (nose) or did you boost the saturation ?  Nicely blurred background makes this effective.</td>', 'good portrait sports shot.  Exposure seems a little bit hot (the legs and helment are over exposed) but other than that it is good - is his face really that orange (nose) or did you boost the saturation ?  Nicely blurred background makes this effective.', '2003-09-15 11:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(419455, 37294, 656, '<td valign="top">Feels like a ''spot the ball'' competition.  Good action and emotion, I just wish the ball was still in the frame.</td>', 'Feels like a ''spot the ball'' competition.  Good action and emotion, I just wish the ball was still in the frame.', '2003-09-15 11:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(419456, 37524, 9669, '<td valign="top">shot in reverse?<br/></td>', 'shot in reverse?', '2003-09-15 11:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(419457, 37563, 6667, '<td valign="top">Why is one hook up and one hook down?  Great action.</td>', 'Why is one hook up and one hook down?  Great action.', '2003-09-15 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(419458, 37760, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow - very unusual take on the sports theme.  Good capture with both jacks being sent out to and an interesting composition repeating the theme.</td>', 'Wow - very unusual take on the sports theme.  Good capture with both jacks being sent out to and an interesting composition repeating the theme.', '2003-09-15 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(419459, 37595, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2003-09-15 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(419460, 37594, 6667, '<td valign="top">I take it from the [osition of the horses and lances. . . they missed!</td>', 'I take it from the [osition of the horses and lances. . . they missed!', '2003-09-15 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(419461, 37596, 9441, '<td valign="top">cool shot!  I love the shadow...</td>', 'cool shot!  I love the shadow...', '2003-09-15 11:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(419462, 37842, 656, '<td valign="top">Great slow flash shot - certainly captured some action with this!  The hot highlights on the chainring don''t bother me at all - works really well.  Good entry (9)</td>', 'Great slow flash shot - certainly captured some action with this!  The hot highlights on the chainring don''t bother me at all - works really well.  Good entry (9)', '2003-09-15 11:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(419463, 37613, 656, '<td valign="top">good action, sharp focus, nicely soft background</td>', 'good action, sharp focus, nicely soft background', '2003-09-15 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(419464, 37643, 6008, '<td valign="top">Having the helmet and upper torso of the ''main'' player be in focus and the rest slightly out of it works well for this image. I''m not an expert of sports photography, and admit to not even reading much of the sports pages, but most of the images I recall always seem to be a select few players (perhaps it''s a compositional thing), however, the fact that the frame is crowded by players emphasises the rush of the ''main'' player. His struggle is obvious, the expression on his face suggests it, and the guy behind him looks like he''s coming right for him too. This is a shot that makes me want to know what happened next, which would probably be explained in an accompanying article. It clearly demonstrates action, and dirty, strenous action at that. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'Having the helmet and upper torso of the ''main'' player be in focus and the rest slightly out of it works well for this image. I''m not an expert of sports photography, and admit to not even reading much of the sports pages, but most of the images I recall always seem to be a select few players (perhaps it''s a compositional thing), however, the fact that the frame is crowded by players emphasises the rush of the ''main'' player. His struggle is obvious, the expression on his face suggests it, and the guy behind him looks like he''s coming right for him too. This is a shot that makes me want to know what happened next, which would probably be explained in an accompanying article. It clearly demonstrates action, and dirty, strenous action at that. Very nicely captured.', '2003-09-15 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(419465, 37200, 656, '<td valign="top">good panning shot but the car detail is pretty blocky ?</td>', 'good panning shot but the car detail is pretty blocky ?', '2003-09-15 11:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(419466, 37595, 9441, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!  Beautiful sunset.....very expressive and emotive!  Two thumbs up!</td>', 'Awesome photo!  Beautiful sunset.....very expressive and emotive!  Two thumbs up!', '2003-09-15 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(419467, 37616, 656, '<td valign="top">The umbrella really enhances the feel of the shot and hides a probably white sky too very effectively.  The horizon tilt is a bit annoying/ disconcerting though.  Good shot.  A faster shutter speed would have crisped things up a bit, but I guess the light was pretty dim with the weather</td>', 'The umbrella really enhances the feel of the shot and hides a probably white sky too very effectively.  The horizon tilt is a bit annoying/ disconcerting though.  Good shot.  A faster shutter speed would have crisped things up a bit, but I guess the light was pretty dim with the weather', '2003-09-15 11:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419468, 37807, 656, '<td valign="top">great action.  good capture.</td>', 'great action.  good capture.', '2003-09-15 11:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(419469, 37582, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice paddock shot with lots of colors. I do think it''s a bit too bright. (sun) Hard to control I know. Also the person on the left is cut in half and a bit of a distraction. The subjects are beautiful.</td>', 'Nice paddock shot with lots of colors. I do think it''s a bit too bright. (sun) Hard to control I know. Also the person on the left is cut in half and a bit of a distraction. The subjects are beautiful.', '2003-09-15 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419471, 37763, 656, '<td valign="top">Exposure on the ball is really hot - the white is blown out</td>', 'Exposure on the ball is really hot - the white is blown out', '2003-09-15 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(419472, 37613, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark, but it captures the anticipation of action very well. The image is very clear, the focus is great, and I have to admit that the little cloud of dust near her foot and by the ball really makes the photo. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'It''s a little dark, but it captures the anticipation of action very well. The image is very clear, the focus is great, and I have to admit that the little cloud of dust near her foot and by the ball really makes the photo. Very nicely captured.', '2003-09-15 11:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(419475, 37552, 327, '<td valign="top">I like the composition/perspective. The colors are a bit over saturated for my eye. Still it''s a good action shot. Nice going.</td>', 'I like the composition/perspective. The colors are a bit over saturated for my eye. Still it''s a good action shot. Nice going.', '2003-09-15 11:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(419476, 37852, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat view.</td>', 'Neat view.', '2003-09-15 11:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(419477, 37655, 327, '<td valign="top">Yes, keep it up. Remind him of the $ that Woods makes. Cute shot, little dark and the crop on the left is a bit tight.</td>', 'Yes, keep it up. Remind him of the $ that Woods makes. Cute shot, little dark and the crop on the left is a bit tight.', '2003-09-15 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(419478, 37643, 6667, '<td valign="top">A faster shutter speed and this would have been an excellent capture.  Not bad as it is.</td>', 'A faster shutter speed and this would have been an excellent capture.  Not bad as it is.', '2003-09-15 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1);
