(419540, 37552, 656, '<td valign="top">Great, graphic composition, love the background textures in particular .  The sport almost feels secondary to me than the impact of that large red triangle pointing in towards the batsman.  Cool shot! (10)</td>', 'Great, graphic composition, love the background textures in particular .  The sport almost feels secondary to me than the impact of that large red triangle pointing in towards the batsman.  Cool shot! (10)', '2003-09-15 11:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
