(419692, 37693, 4967, '<td valign="top">great job with the motion here :-)  nicely done... good composition, love the kind of ghostly hand... I actually think it might have been nice to crop out the wall at the top, I don''t think it would have taken anything away from the shot, and would have gotten rid of the distracting lightness of the wall. -7-</td>', 'great job with the motion here :-)  nicely done... good composition, love the kind of ghostly hand... I actually think it might have been nice to crop out the wall at the top, I don''t think it would have taken anything away from the shot, and would have gotten rid of the distracting lightness of the wall. -7-', '2003-09-15 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419695, 37265, 4967, '<td valign="top">You are going to get ripped by DPCers, but I think this is really cool... you caught the intenseness of the person running, and some motion, I like it... very neat and untraditional, wish his bottom fist was completely in the photo though.-8-</td>', 'You are going to get ripped by DPCers, but I think this is really cool... you caught the intenseness of the person running, and some motion, I like it... very neat and untraditional, wish his bottom fist was completely in the photo though.-8-', '2003-09-15 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
