(419699, 37685, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you would have cropped out the rider on this one.  Seems like it could have been a pretty strong shot had the rider not been amputated.</td>', 'Not sure why you would have cropped out the rider on this one.  Seems like it could have been a pretty strong shot had the rider not been amputated.', '2003-09-15 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(419705, 37835, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the action that is happening here, good catch however I''m bothered by the fact that there  is no ball present in the picture, I was always trained that a good sports photo has to have the ball in it.  Thats just what I learned, otherwise nice job... I might have cropped tighter also.  -6-</td>', 'I like the action that is happening here, good catch however I''m bothered by the fact that there  is no ball present in the picture, I was always trained that a good sports photo has to have the ball in it.  Thats just what I learned, otherwise nice job... I might have cropped tighter also.  -6-', '2003-09-15 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(419707, 37635, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great action here!  There is so much going on in this photo!  One good rule in sports is to crop as tightly as possible, there is a lot of extra grass around that you could have cropped out.... Love that guy in the air though!</td>', 'Great action here!  There is so much going on in this photo!  One good rule in sports is to crop as tightly as possible, there is a lot of extra grass around that you could have cropped out.... Love that guy in the air though!', '2003-09-15 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(419709, 37733, 4967, '<td valign="top">Just curious what racking is, I''ve never heard of it.  This looks like dressage to me.  I would have cropped in a LOT... So that you get some of the crowd watching, and the horse and person but without the blown out background and the tons of extra ring.</td>', 'Just curious what racking is, I''ve never heard of it.  This looks like dressage to me.  I would have cropped in a LOT... So that you get some of the crowd watching, and the horse and person but without the blown out background and the tons of extra ring.', '2003-09-15 14:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
