(419903, 37852, 12075, '<td valign="top">I think this is a unique way to view the topic. I am glad to see the light at the top..great job</td>', 'I think this is a unique way to view the topic. I am glad to see the light at the top..great job', '2003-09-15 17:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
