(419919, 37655, 10643, '<td valign="top">would like this better if the ball weren''t cropped quite so close to the edge. cute shot.</td>', 'would like this better if the ball weren''t cropped quite so close to the edge. cute shot.', '2003-09-15 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(419920, 37568, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far. Outstanding colors and motion.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far. Outstanding colors and motion.', '2003-09-15 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(419921, 37576, 10643, '<td valign="top">Very good action shot. I think the border overpowers the shot. Shame about the fishing boat being right there, too.</td>', 'Very good action shot. I think the border overpowers the shot. Shame about the fishing boat being right there, too.', '2003-09-15 17:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(419922, 37595, 10643, '<td valign="top">wish the surfer were more visible, but the sky is great. a real "endless summer" feel to this.</td>', 'wish the surfer were more visible, but the sky is great. a real "endless summer" feel to this.', '2003-09-15 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(419925, 37760, 10643, '<td valign="top">at the same time I like and dislike the pure black field. more detail would make this clearer, at least as far as where the balls are (they look like they''re in midair). but also the black and white of it puts a ton of focus on the men and their stance and their clothes, and there''s a real old-fashioned feel to it. It''s growing on me.</td>', 'at the same time I like and dislike the pure black field. more detail would make this clearer, at least as far as where the balls are (they look like they''re in midair). but also the black and white of it puts a ton of focus on the men and their stance and their clothes, and there''s a real old-fashioned feel to it. It''s growing on me.', '2003-09-15 17:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(419927, 37852, 10643, '<td valign="top">would like this a lot more if the backlight illuminated the whole net.</td>', 'would like this a lot more if the backlight illuminated the whole net.', '2003-09-15 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(419929, 37294, 10643, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus were more clearly on just one girl, and that we could see where the ball is</td>', 'I wish the focus were more clearly on just one girl, and that we could see where the ball is', '2003-09-15 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(419931, 37715, 10643, '<td valign="top">would like to see this cropped higher, maybe about where the shadow changes the color of the grass. so that 2/3 of the frame is net, instead of 2/3 being grass. right now the eye is drawn to the strong horizontal of the shade on the grass, not to the soccer game.</td>', 'would like to see this cropped higher, maybe about where the shadow changes the color of the grass. so that 2/3 of the frame is net, instead of 2/3 being grass. right now the eye is drawn to the strong horizontal of the shade on the grass, not to the soccer game.', '2003-09-15 17:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(419933, 37652, 10643, '<td valign="top">this looks just like a beach I''m very familiar with. looking forward to finding out where it was taken!</td>', 'this looks just like a beach I''m very familiar with. looking forward to finding out where it was taken!', '2003-09-15 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(419934, 37471, 10643, '<td valign="top">a great take on the challenge! one of the few laugh-out-loud originals here. wonderful color and motion, I hope you do well :)</td>', 'a great take on the challenge! one of the few laugh-out-loud originals here. wonderful color and motion, I hope you do well :)', '2003-09-15 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(419935, 37042, 10643, '<td valign="top">wow, a real sense of motion and strength here. seeing the horse balanced like this, where he could obviously only have been for a split second, and the cloud of dust, brings a definite urgency to the shot. I think I might like to see it from the front but the action is definitely there.</td>', 'wow, a real sense of motion and strength here. seeing the horse balanced like this, where he could obviously only have been for a split second, and the cloud of dust, brings a definite urgency to the shot. I think I might like to see it from the front but the action is definitely there.', '2003-09-15 17:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(419936, 37783, 10643, '<td valign="top">the aftereffect really doesn''t add anything to this. it would have been a neat volleyball shot without it, especially with the ball on top of the net like that. but now it''s just strange.</td>', 'the aftereffect really doesn''t add anything to this. it would have been a neat volleyball shot without it, especially with the ball on top of the net like that. but now it''s just strange.', '2003-09-15 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(419937, 37790, 10643, '<td valign="top">would like to see this from a slightly different angle, so that the fishing pole isn''t blocked by/meeting with the tree branches. if it were just her and the rock and the water it would be a better composition.</td>', 'would like to see this from a slightly different angle, so that the fishing pole isn''t blocked by/meeting with the tree branches. if it were just her and the rock and the water it would be a better composition.', '2003-09-15 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(419939, 37330, 10643, '<td valign="top">great lighting by itself, and the motion on the pawn adds the action. the best chess shot in the challenge.</td>', 'great lighting by itself, and the motion on the pawn adds the action. the best chess shot in the challenge.', '2003-09-15 18:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(419940, 37807, 10643, '<td valign="top">less "artsy" than a couple of the other surfing shots, but *definitely* more fun. I like this a lot.</td>', 'less "artsy" than a couple of the other surfing shots, but *definitely* more fun. I like this a lot.', '2003-09-15 18:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(419941, 37417, 10643, '<td valign="top">one of my top two in the challenge. both the action of the sport and the emotion of the little brother on the sidelines are here in force.</td>', 'one of my top two in the challenge. both the action of the sport and the emotion of the little brother on the sidelines are here in force.', '2003-09-15 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(419948, 37042, 10883, '<td valign="top">Great pic, nice timing! - 8</td>', 'Great pic, nice timing! - 8', '2003-09-15 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(419949, 37493, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but it lacks movement, the cart looks like it is standing still.</td>', 'Nice pic but it lacks movement, the cart looks like it is standing still.', '2003-09-15 18:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(419953, 37563, 3599, '<td valign="top">Lots of field hockey photos this week but this is the best hands down and I''ve got to say best Sports shot of the week as well.  Great composition, color, focus and action.  Good luck, I predict top 3 finish here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-22 00:05:00.</i></td>', 'Lots of field hockey photos this week but this is the best hands down and I''ve got to say best Sports shot of the week as well.  Great composition, color, focus and action.  Good luck, I predict top 3 finish here.', '2003-09-15 18:21:58.000000', '2003-09-22 01:05:00.000000', 1),
(419954, 37783, 10883, '<td valign="top">The effect of this picture ruins it for me...</td>', 'The effect of this picture ruins it for me...', '2003-09-15 18:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(419955, 37802, 10883, '<td valign="top">Great picture and great timing!  Love the expression on their faces! - 10<br/> <br/>(Býst sterklega við að þetta sé ArniT.  Flott mynd!)</td>', 'Great picture and great timing!  Love the expression on their faces! - 10 (Býst sterklega við að þetta sé ArniT.  Flott mynd!)', '2003-09-15 18:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(419957, 37643, 10883, '<td valign="top">Great timing!  Good picture! - 9</td>', 'Great timing!  Good picture! - 9', '2003-09-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(419958, 37568, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter shot of the break would have been better.  The table in the background doesn''t add anything to the photo in my opinion.  I do like the motion on the balls though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think a tighter shot of the break would have been better.  The table in the background doesn''t add anything to the photo in my opinion.  I do like the motion on the balls though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-09-15 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(419960, 37613, 10883, '<td valign="top">Cool timing! - 8</td>', 'Cool timing! - 8', '2003-09-15 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(419964, 37763, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice concept!  The only thing that bugs me is that the golfball is overexposed and it loses a lot of detail...</td>', 'Nice concept!  The only thing that bugs me is that the golfball is overexposed and it loses a lot of detail...', '2003-09-15 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
