(420324, 37007, 173, '<td valign="top">This kind of shot and how it was captured is what sports photography is all about! Great job!</td>', 'This kind of shot and how it was captured is what sports photography is all about! Great job!', '2003-09-16 02:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
