(420329, 37558, 9073, '<td valign="top">LOL. You''ve tried to address the challenge of action by putting a sports drink and a guy dressed in sports gear into your shot. Too much space at the top. Colours a bit bland. Oh, the fact that the king is down means that the opponent has resigned, not checkmate.</td>', 'LOL. You''ve tried to address the challenge of action by putting a sports drink and a guy dressed in sports gear into your shot. Too much space at the top. Colours a bit bland. Oh, the fact that the king is down means that the opponent has resigned, not checkmate.', '2003-09-16 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(420330, 37801, 9441, '<td valign="top">Great shot....wonderful color...</td>', 'Great shot....wonderful color...', '2003-09-16 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(420332, 37715, 9073, '<td valign="top">I feel that there''s far too much foreground here.</td>', 'I feel that there''s far too much foreground here.', '2003-09-16 02:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
