(420334, 37265, 9073, '<td valign="top">Interesting. A bit scary, though, for a running man. Re-title it ''the boxer'' and I''ll give you a high score.</td>', 'Interesting. A bit scary, though, for a running man. Re-title it ''the boxer'' and I''ll give you a high score.', '2003-09-16 02:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(420337, 37807, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wow....good shot!  I love all the wave action...so closeup and personal....I can almost feel the ocean spray.....good job...</td>', 'Wow....good shot!  I love all the wave action...so closeup and personal....I can almost feel the ocean spray.....good job...', '2003-09-16 02:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(420338, 37200, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. These are difficult shots to make. You did very well here. (I sound like a schoolteacher. Forgive me.)</td>', 'Nicely captured. These are difficult shots to make. You did very well here. (I sound like a schoolteacher. Forgive me.)', '2003-09-16 02:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
