(420434, 37808, 10806, '<td valign="top">Great Pic!!! I luv the shot, i think the ball being blurry really adds to it, it shows that there is really motoin in this shot! I Love the van in the background! But the funniest is she is wearing a toronto maple leafs shirt, has a baseball cap on and is playing basketball! LOL Good pic!</td>', 'Great Pic!!! I luv the shot, i think the ball being blurry really adds to it, it shows that there is really motoin in this shot! I Love the van in the background! But the funniest is she is wearing a toronto maple leafs shirt, has a baseball cap on and is playing basketball! LOL Good pic!', '2003-09-16 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
