(420646, 37563, 8250, '<td valign="top">i love the action you have in this shot, captured beuatifully and lit really well i would have thought about cropping it but i think you have it just right, i would be surprised if your not in the top 10 with this one well done 9</td>', 'i love the action you have in this shot, captured beuatifully and lit really well i would have thought about cropping it but i think you have it just right, i would be surprised if your not in the top 10 with this one well done 9', '2003-09-16 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
