(420935, 37760, 7763, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo but  what are they doing?  Maybe i''m just dense... still trying to figure it out</td>', 'Interesting photo but  what are they doing?  Maybe i''m just dense... still trying to figure it out', '2003-09-16 22:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(420937, 37576, 7763, '<td valign="top">great shot but the first thing I see is the border...still a beautiful photo</td>', 'great shot but the first thing I see is the border...still a beautiful photo', '2003-09-16 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
