(422124, 37693, 6999, '<td valign="top">Some lens distortion, and the lighting seems a bi odd - brighter one end of the table than the other: not sure that the hand isn''t too far out of frame for a really attention-grabbing composition, too.</td>', 'Some lens distortion, and the lighting seems a bi odd - brighter one end of the table than the other: not sure that the hand isn''t too far out of frame for a really attention-grabbing composition, too.', '2003-09-17 17:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(422125, 37508, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something odddly distracting about the red horse having all four feet off the ground :-) There''s a lack of detail too - texture to the horses, and details of the flying dirt have been lost - perhaps too much zooming or cropping?</td>', 'Something odddly distracting about the red horse having all four feet off the ground :-) There''s a lack of detail too - texture to the horses, and details of the flying dirt have been lost - perhaps too much zooming or cropping?', '2003-09-17 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
