(422227, 37551, 8860, '<td valign="top">Faster shutter speed would make this more impressive. Not quite enough going on really.</td>', 'Faster shutter speed would make this more impressive. Not quite enough going on really.', '2003-09-17 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
