(422763, 37009, 11073, '<td valign="top">good shot...framed well.</td>', 'good shot...framed well.', '2003-09-18 05:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(422767, 37595, 11073, '<td valign="top">great shot.  everything about it is beautiful.  The perfect sunset, great atmospheric element, the breaking waves, the sufers pose, the silhouette, the colors, the composition.  nice work.  *applause*</td>', 'great shot.  everything about it is beautiful.  The perfect sunset, great atmospheric element, the breaking waves, the sufers pose, the silhouette, the colors, the composition.  nice work.  *applause*', '2003-09-18 05:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(422772, 37763, 11073, '<td valign="top">=`) lol, yeah....I always play in the rough stuff....i don''t live where its THAT rough :) but I still feel your pain!!  I wish the ball logo wasn''t so blown out....everything else is in great color.  nice pic.</td>', '=`) lol, yeah....I always play in the rough stuff....i don''t live where its THAT rough :) but I still feel your pain!!  I wish the ball logo wasn''t so blown out....everything else is in great color.  nice pic.', '2003-09-18 05:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(422774, 37563, 11073, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot.  very good.  composed very well. nice eye and timing.  the dof is good too.  the facial expressions are cool - the lead girl has determination to score on her face, the defender behind has a gritty determination look to steal the ball away  - and the out of focus girl trailing behind the play has a *huh....oh no* look on her face.  nice work.</td>', 'GREAT shot.  very good.  composed very well. nice eye and timing.  the dof is good too.  the facial expressions are cool - the lead girl has determination to score on her face, the defender behind has a gritty determination look to steal the ball away  - and the out of focus girl trailing behind the play has a *huh....oh no* look on her face.  nice work.', '2003-09-18 05:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(422827, 37835, 10236, '<td valign="top">Nice action, wish there was a ball in the pic</td>', 'Nice action, wish there was a ball in the pic', '2003-09-18 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(422922, 37460, 11022, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if "action to follow" constitutes "action" but this is a compelling photo and really captured my interest.</td>', 'I don''t know if "action to follow" constitutes "action" but this is a compelling photo and really captured my interest.', '2003-09-18 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(422926, 37009, 11022, '<td valign="top">Great title on this excellent action shot..</td>', 'Great title on this excellent action shot..', '2003-09-18 11:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(422964, 37009, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really quite good.  You''ve got the ball in the photo, which is very importatn and you show some great action in the fact the guy is going down... I wish I could see more facial expressions, but thats hard because of the helmets.  The main person is quite centered, but I''m not sure you could have cropped any differently.  The guy upper left bothers me, the fact that he has his head cut off, but nothing you could do there.  Overall a very good sports photo.  -8-</td>', 'This is really quite good.  You''ve got the ball in the photo, which is very importatn and you show some great action in the fact the guy is going down... I wish I could see more facial expressions, but thats hard because of the helmets.  The main person is quite centered, but I''m not sure you could have cropped any differently.  The guy upper left bothers me, the fact that he has his head cut off, but nothing you could do there.  Overall a very good sports photo.  -8-', '2003-09-18 12:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(422979, 37042, 2883, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the action. Very crisp. Maybe a little more contrast might help to creat more depth in the photo.</td>', 'Great capture of the action. Very crisp. Maybe a little more contrast might help to creat more depth in the photo.', '2003-09-18 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(422982, 37594, 2883, '<td valign="top">Great submission. I think this photo would be better in color. It could be just a bit sharper as well. Other than that, I like it.</td>', 'Great submission. I think this photo would be better in color. It could be just a bit sharper as well. Other than that, I like it.', '2003-09-18 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(422985, 37801, 2883, '<td valign="top">Good action and use of the blue sky for a backdrop. The plane could stand out a little more.</td>', 'Good action and use of the blue sky for a backdrop. The plane could stand out a little more.', '2003-09-18 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(422988, 37807, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice detail of the action. The contrasts could be enhanced a bit.</td>', 'Nice detail of the action. The contrasts could be enhanced a bit.', '2003-09-18 12:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(422990, 37824, 2883, '<td valign="top">The anticipation of striking the ball creates the action here. Great use of DOF. The colors could be enhanced a little.</td>', 'The anticipation of striking the ball creates the action here. Great use of DOF. The colors could be enhanced a little.', '2003-09-18 12:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(422991, 37238, 2883, '<td valign="top">Good use of camera angle and sun positioning. Good composition. The tree limbs at the base are little distracting.</td>', 'Good use of camera angle and sun positioning. Good composition. The tree limbs at the base are little distracting.', '2003-09-18 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(423086, 37634, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring and the facial expressions in this photo. It almost looks like a dance gone wrong.</td>', 'I like the coloring and the facial expressions in this photo. It almost looks like a dance gone wrong.', '2003-09-18 14:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(423087, 37763, 2883, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the ball is a little too harsh for the photo. I think it detracts from the sharp prickers of the cactus. Otherwise, it''s a great composition.</td>', 'The brightness of the ball is a little too harsh for the photo. I think it detracts from the sharp prickers of the cactus. Otherwise, it''s a great composition.', '2003-09-18 14:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(423089, 37825, 2883, '<td valign="top">This might have been a little better of a photo if it was taken on the other side of the street for lighting purposes. The calm expression of the rider enhances the appearance of motion.</td>', 'This might have been a little better of a photo if it was taken on the other side of the street for lighting purposes. The calm expression of the rider enhances the appearance of motion.', '2003-09-18 14:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(423091, 37810, 2883, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t show much action, but I love the idea. I think it might be better with color.</td>', 'This doesn''t show much action, but I love the idea. I think it might be better with color.', '2003-09-18 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(423099, 37294, 2883, '<td valign="top">The color could be brightened a little and the photo could be a little sharper, but the expression on the face and the appearance of the girl kicking her is a great capture. Who said soccer isn''t a contact sport?</td>', 'The color could be brightened a little and the photo could be a little sharper, but the expression on the face and the appearance of the girl kicking her is a great capture. Who said soccer isn''t a contact sport?', '2003-09-18 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(423112, 37801, 11283, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors! You captured a really nice moment, when the light is hitting the smoke and plane just right. Nice!</td>', 'Really nice colors! You captured a really nice moment, when the light is hitting the smoke and plane just right. Nice!', '2003-09-18 14:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(423114, 37648, 11283, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed IMHO but you captured a true emotion we have all felt. Nice depth of field.</td>', 'Slightly overexposed IMHO but you captured a true emotion we have all felt. Nice depth of field.', '2003-09-18 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(423117, 37652, 11283, '<td valign="top">Pic is a bit fuzzy I assume from a close crop-but you caught some nice action. You can almost hear the guy yell "Oh sh*t!"</td>', 'Pic is a bit fuzzy I assume from a close crop-but you caught some nice action. You can almost hear the guy yell "Oh sh*t!"', '2003-09-18 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(423118, 37594, 11283, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Good contrast.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Good contrast.', '2003-09-18 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(423123, 37596, 11283, '<td valign="top">Good action shot and great catch! I think a lower angle helps shots like this though.</td>', 'Good action shot and great catch! I think a lower angle helps shots like this though.', '2003-09-18 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(423136, 37613, 11283, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and you can see the grit kicked up by the shoes! Cool.</td>', 'Nice depth of field and you can see the grit kicked up by the shoes! Cool.', '2003-09-18 14:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(423160, 36920, 11283, '<td valign="top">Cool shot-hope there were no sharks...</td>', 'Cool shot-hope there were no sharks...', '2003-09-18 15:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(423175, 37760, 11283, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. It should be called "Showdown in a black hole" Hehe. But nice photo. 8.</td>', 'I really like this one. It should be called "Showdown in a black hole" Hehe. But nice photo. 8.', '2003-09-18 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(423183, 37639, 11283, '<td valign="top">I like the vibe of this photo. A bit fuzzy though...</td>', 'I like the vibe of this photo. A bit fuzzy though...', '2003-09-18 15:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(423192, 37417, 11283, '<td valign="top">Wow-great photo. You captured the feeling great. Doesn''t even need the title.</td>', 'Wow-great photo. You captured the feeling great. Doesn''t even need the title.', '2003-09-18 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(423230, 37330, 11283, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of chess shots in this challenge...this one is the best.</td>', 'There is a lot of chess shots in this challenge...this one is the best.', '2003-09-18 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(423307, 37265, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very neat effect, looking forward to seeing how it was done. Probably a bit too unreal for the DPC crowd. I like it though - great glowing colours and a good sense of motion. The fist out in front stands out and grabs the attention nicely. Good stuff.</td>', 'Very neat effect, looking forward to seeing how it was done. Probably a bit too unreal for the DPC crowd. I like it though - great glowing colours and a good sense of motion. The fist out in front stands out and grabs the attention nicely. Good stuff.', '2003-09-18 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(423310, 37801, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice. The shape of the smoke trail is excellent, and the plane, despite being small in the frame, is clear and well exposed.</td>', 'Nice. The shape of the smoke trail is excellent, and the plane, despite being small in the frame, is clear and well exposed.', '2003-09-18 17:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(423315, 37635, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot and well exposed - not easy with all that white. I like that you got the defender in mid-air, it adds alot to the shot. Could stand a tighter crop on the right of the frame, otherwise composition is spot on.</td>', 'Good clear shot and well exposed - not easy with all that white. I like that you got the defender in mid-air, it adds alot to the shot. Could stand a tighter crop on the right of the frame, otherwise composition is spot on.', '2003-09-18 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(423326, 37842, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. How did you manage to keep the camera so steady while running alongside the bike? ; )<br/>Great motion blur, it works really well, and good composition.</td>', 'Excellent shot. How did you manage to keep the camera so steady while running alongside the bike? ; )Great motion blur, it works really well, and good composition.', '2003-09-18 17:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(423333, 37685, 4411, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that you''ve cut off the riders upper body &amp; head. For me the rider is more important in a sports shot than the machine (s)he is riding.<br/>Technically it''s not bad, but lacks a little sharpness.</td>', 'I don''t like that you''ve cut off the riders upper body & head. For me the rider is more important in a sports shot than the machine (s)he is riding.Technically it''s not bad, but lacks a little sharpness.', '2003-09-18 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(423339, 37736, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot. Focus is spot on and I like that you can just about make out a bridge in the background.<br/>I don''t think you could ask anything more from a windsurfing shot.</td>', 'Nice clear shot. Focus is spot on and I like that you can just about make out a bridge in the background.I don''t think you could ask anything more from a windsurfing shot.', '2003-09-18 17:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(423351, 37563, 2867, '<td valign="top">Finally someone included field hockey!  So often we are forgotten about, yet its one of the greatest girls sports!  Great sharpness, it''s hard when they''re going so fast.  Really nice colors too.</td>', 'Finally someone included field hockey!  So often we are forgotten about, yet its one of the greatest girls sports!  Great sharpness, it''s hard when they''re going so fast.  Really nice colors too.', '2003-09-18 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(423402, 37802, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent football shot, the colours are fantastic.</td>', 'Excellent football shot, the colours are fantastic.', '2003-09-18 18:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(423407, 37748, 4411, '<td valign="top">Superb capture. Could do with straightening up, but the quality of the shot itself can''t be faulted.</td>', 'Superb capture. Could do with straightening up, but the quality of the shot itself can''t be faulted.', '2003-09-18 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(423411, 37007, 4411, '<td valign="top">First off, I hate your title - the details in brackets should just be in the the details section for us to see after the challenge. ''Screen Pass'' however is an excellent title.<br/>Rant over, on to the photo. Wow. This is an absolutely perfect capture. The moment, the look on the receivers face, the clarity, everything is spot on. 10</td>', 'First off, I hate your title - the details in brackets should just be in the the details section for us to see after the challenge. ''Screen Pass'' however is an excellent title.Rant over, on to the photo. Wow. This is an absolutely perfect capture. The moment, the look on the receivers face, the clarity, everything is spot on. 10', '2003-09-18 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(423428, 37639, 4411, '<td valign="top">One of those photos I really like but can''t put my finger on why I do.<br/>Lacking sharpness? Who cares. Great shot.</td>', 'One of those photos I really like but can''t put my finger on why I do.Lacking sharpness? Who cares. Great shot.', '2003-09-18 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(423430, 37852, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Composition is great, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Composition is great, I like this a lot.', '2003-09-18 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(423446, 37471, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Love the spin-blur on the ''players'' and the colours are excellent. Having the ball in frame too is a bonus.</td>', 'Great capture! Love the spin-blur on the ''players'' and the colours are excellent. Having the ball in frame too is a bonus.', '2003-09-18 19:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(423448, 37829, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The composition is great and I love the colour of the statue.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The composition is great and I love the colour of the statue.', '2003-09-18 19:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(423465, 37807, 4411, '<td valign="top">*Very* nice capture. You know exactly where he''s gonna be in half a seconds time : )<br/>I tried shooting surfers on holiday last week but even stood knee deep in the see I couldn''t get close enough to get a shot like this. I''m jealous. A reluctant 10 ; )</td>', '*Very* nice capture. You know exactly where he''s gonna be in half a seconds time : )I tried shooting surfers on holiday last week but even stood knee deep in the see I couldn''t get close enough to get a shot like this. I''m jealous. A reluctant 10 ; )', '2003-09-18 19:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(423466, 37294, 9441, '<td valign="top">great action shot, nice color</td>', 'great action shot, nice color', '2003-09-18 19:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(423477, 37200, 4411, '<td valign="top">Panning is good, but the car is way blown out and not quite sharp.<br/>White cars are a pain to shoot at the best of times, especially in sunshine. The over-exposure has however created an interesting effect, making the shot look almost painted or something. As sports journalism it doesn''t quite work, but as art it definitely does. I like it.</td>', 'Panning is good, but the car is way blown out and not quite sharp.White cars are a pain to shoot at the best of times, especially in sunshine. The over-exposure has however created an interesting effect, making the shot look almost painted or something. As sports journalism it doesn''t quite work, but as art it definitely does. I like it.', '2003-09-18 19:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(423482, 37417, 9441, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, great feeling of emotion, I like it in the black &amp; white</td>', 'Nicely done, great feeling of emotion, I like it in the black & white', '2003-09-18 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(423501, 37736, 9441, '<td valign="top">This is so cool...great shot...wonderful feeling attached to this photo!</td>', 'This is so cool...great shot...wonderful feeling attached to this photo!', '2003-09-18 20:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(423504, 37812, 9441, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, great color and depth, nice angle</td>', 'Really nice photo, great color and depth, nice angle', '2003-09-18 20:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
