(423519, 37745, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting what you''ve done here... is that a paintball gun?  I find it somewhat disconcerting to see the floating head, but kind of cool as well.  How did you do it?  The lighting is slightly harsh on part of the mask, but not a big deal.  I wish there was some hint of action instead of just a posed shot though.</td>', 'This is quite interesting what you''ve done here... is that a paintball gun?  I find it somewhat disconcerting to see the floating head, but kind of cool as well.  How did you do it?  The lighting is slightly harsh on part of the mask, but not a big deal.  I wish there was some hint of action instead of just a posed shot though.', '2003-09-18 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
