(424345, 37576, 9241, '<td valign="top">%^$# boat. nice shot</td>', '%^$# boat. nice shot', '2003-09-19 22:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424354, 37563, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The slight motion blur makes this shot very dynamic.  top 3 for sure.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The slight motion blur makes this shot very dynamic.  top 3 for sure.  Jacko.  10', '2003-09-19 22:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424358, 37643, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love how the helmet is in focus and the rest is slightly blurred, giving it a very dynamic feeling.  Good luck. Very well done  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wow!  Love how the helmet is in focus and the rest is slightly blurred, giving it a very dynamic feeling.  Good luck. Very well done  Jacko.  10', '2003-09-19 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(424360, 37042, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Very dynamic shot.  nIce stop motion.  The dust really makes gives it character.  Jacko. 8</td>', 'Excellent.  Very dynamic shot.  nIce stop motion.  The dust really makes gives it character.  Jacko. 8', '2003-09-19 22:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424362, 36920, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  2 in one.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Great capture.  2 in one.  Good luck.  Jacko.  8', '2003-09-19 22:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(424364, 37417, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Cute take on sports.  Very very true.  Thanks for the smiles.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  Cute take on sports.  Very very true.  Thanks for the smiles.  Jacko.  9', '2003-09-19 22:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424365, 37576, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Would like to see the shot without the boat in the background, but still a very nice crisp shot.  Very dymanic.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Great capture.  Would like to see the shot without the boat in the background, but still a very nice crisp shot.  Very dymanic.  Jacko.  9', '2003-09-19 22:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424369, 37697, 2716, '<td valign="top">well, I''m a sucker for athletic women in skimpy bathing suits jumping up and down.  Very dynamic shot.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'well, I''m a sucker for athletic women in skimpy bathing suits jumping up and down.  Very dynamic shot.  Jacko.  10', '2003-09-19 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424392, 37715, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I''m not sure why you choose to put SO much space in the front, I think this actually could have been very effective as a wide short shot.  Great action here, it''s almost like a whole story book, lots of stuff happening, I almost wonder if there isn''t too much.  Very effective in black and white!  For some reason I just really like the unique look to this shot.  -8-</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I''m not sure why you choose to put SO much space in the front, I think this actually could have been very effective as a wide short shot.  Great action here, it''s almost like a whole story book, lots of stuff happening, I almost wonder if there isn''t too much.  Very effective in black and white!  For some reason I just really like the unique look to this shot.  -8-', '2003-09-19 23:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(424395, 37551, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good cropping here, obviously you couldn''t get very close so I''m not going to complain about them not being bigger.  Just curious where the ball is... I can''t see it unless it''s that blur on the left side?  I like the motion of the bat, but I wish we could see the ball a little more clearly.  So did he hit the shot?  Personally I would have cropped out the extra warm up batter on the upper right, but thats just me...</td>', 'Good cropping here, obviously you couldn''t get very close so I''m not going to complain about them not being bigger.  Just curious where the ball is... I can''t see it unless it''s that blur on the left side?  I like the motion of the bat, but I wish we could see the ball a little more clearly.  So did he hit the shot?  Personally I would have cropped out the extra warm up batter on the upper right, but thats just me...', '2003-09-19 23:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(424398, 37596, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot, I love the shadow!  Great catch getting him off the ground... did he JUST catch the frisbee?  I would have liked to have seen maybe a tiny bit more detail in the white but it''s not a huge deal... pretty good composition.  I wouldn''t have included the border, but I''m not big on borders.  Nice clear action shot, good job.</td>', 'This is a fun shot, I love the shadow!  Great catch getting him off the ground... did he JUST catch the frisbee?  I would have liked to have seen maybe a tiny bit more detail in the white but it''s not a huge deal... pretty good composition.  I wouldn''t have included the border, but I''m not big on borders.  Nice clear action shot, good job.', '2003-09-19 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(424400, 37763, 2716, '<td valign="top">yikes.  Thanks for the chuckles, from a fellow golfer.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'yikes.  Thanks for the chuckles, from a fellow golfer.  Jacko.  8', '2003-09-19 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(424401, 37460, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is that a fishing lure?  really cool lure, almost looks like a bird or something?!  It bothers me that theres no action in the photo, and really even though it says action to follow I just can''t image anymore.  I''m not sure what you were going for here, but it''s not really a "sports" shot IMHO.</td>', 'Is that a fishing lure?  really cool lure, almost looks like a bird or something?!  It bothers me that theres no action in the photo, and really even though it says action to follow I just can''t image anymore.  I''m not sure what you were going for here, but it''s not really a "sports" shot IMHO.', '2003-09-19 23:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424402, 37595, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great colors and feeling to this shot.  Really shows the dedication of the surg boarder.   Nice capture of the sun.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Great colors and feeling to this shot.  Really shows the dedication of the surg boarder.   Nice capture of the sun.  Jacko.  9', '2003-09-19 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424406, 37335, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like how the ball is on the dead grass with live grass all around it, looks at though the ball has been sitting there for quite a while.  It bothers me there is no action here... maybe the blur of a foot leaving the photo, I''m not sure, but it''s a pretty plain photo as is.  Nothing that really interests me too much here. Sorry</td>', 'I like how the ball is on the dead grass with live grass all around it, looks at though the ball has been sitting there for quite a while.  It bothers me there is no action here... maybe the blur of a foot leaving the photo, I''m not sure, but it''s a pretty plain photo as is.  Nothing that really interests me too much here. Sorry', '2003-09-19 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(424407, 37802, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great stop motion and action shot.  I really like the dynamic feel of this one.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Great stop motion and action shot.  I really like the dynamic feel of this one.  Jacko.  9', '2003-09-19 23:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(424410, 37825, 2716, '<td valign="top">Super panning job and great colors.  Very dynamic.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Super panning job and great colors.  Very dynamic.  Jacko.  10', '2003-09-19 23:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(424412, 37571, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hehehe... thats fun, but I''m wondering where all the other players are?  I like all of the shadows all over the place it kind of looks like those are other players waiting for the guy.  The photo looks a bit underexposed, I think a little more color in the guy and the hockey stick might have been nice... There also doesn''t really seem to be much composition, I find myself looking at the guys eyes and not the ball which is distracting...</td>', 'Hehehe... thats fun, but I''m wondering where all the other players are?  I like all of the shadows all over the place it kind of looks like those are other players waiting for the guy.  The photo looks a bit underexposed, I think a little more color in the guy and the hockey stick might have been nice... There also doesn''t really seem to be much composition, I find myself looking at the guys eyes and not the ball which is distracting...', '2003-09-19 23:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(424413, 37824, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love golf !  Nice set up.  The only I''d change would be to put a golf shoe on the golfer.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'I love golf !  Nice set up.  The only I''d change would be to put a golf shoe on the golfer.  Jacko.  9', '2003-09-19 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424414, 37596, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  very dynamic shot.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Excellent capture.  very dynamic shot.  Jacko.  8', '2003-09-19 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(424416, 37835, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  this is just super.  I love the dynamic feel of the shot,  the crispness of the front players, and the mix of colors.  By far my favorite so far.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wow!  this is just super.  I love the dynamic feel of the shot,  the crispness of the front players, and the mix of colors.  By far my favorite so far.  Jacko.  10', '2003-09-19 23:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(424417, 37639, 4967, '<td valign="top">There''s something off about this picture, I think it is the focus, but also maybe there is too much contrast?  I''m not sure if thats what it is but it is a good captured moment in time.  Not a lot of action here, and truthfully if it wasn''t for the kids jersey I wouldn''t necessarily think that this was sports.</td>', 'There''s something off about this picture, I think it is the focus, but also maybe there is too much contrast?  I''m not sure if thats what it is but it is a good captured moment in time.  Not a lot of action here, and truthfully if it wasn''t for the kids jersey I wouldn''t necessarily think that this was sports.', '2003-09-19 23:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424428, 37802, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action here!  Excellent catch!  Shame about that guy on the left, he really got in the way.  Excellent exposure, excellent catch, tons of action, great colors but that guy is OBNOXIOUS... my eye keeps going to him.  I think maybe I would have cropped at least some of him out, but not sure how I would have cropped him... anyway, except for that great shot!  -9-</td>', 'Wonderful action here!  Excellent catch!  Shame about that guy on the left, he really got in the way.  Excellent exposure, excellent catch, tons of action, great colors but that guy is OBNOXIOUS... my eye keeps going to him.  I think maybe I would have cropped at least some of him out, but not sure how I would have cropped him... anyway, except for that great shot!  -9-', '2003-09-19 23:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(424431, 37736, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, very good exposure here.  I wish he was more to the left hand corner, it would have been better composition I think although I do like the fact that there is some room for him to go into, I think there is almost too much... getting more of the back wave and less of the left side would have been nice, still a nice clear, simple, beautifully done shot... -9-</td>', 'Nice action shot, very good exposure here.  I wish he was more to the left hand corner, it would have been better composition I think although I do like the fact that there is some room for him to go into, I think there is almost too much... getting more of the back wave and less of the left side would have been nice, still a nice clear, simple, beautifully done shot... -9-', '2003-09-19 23:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(424435, 37634, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot here, wish they all weren''t almost just standing on the ground, but it''s a fun shot.  I love the looks on their faces especially the middle kid''s not sure how one would twist yourself into that position, but it looks painful.  A fun shot, that if you know the kids, I''m sure they''d love to have a copy!  Good catch of the ball and everything! Not extremely exciting but a nice solid sports shot.  -8-</td>', 'Nice clear shot here, wish they all weren''t almost just standing on the ground, but it''s a fun shot.  I love the looks on their faces especially the middle kid''s not sure how one would twist yourself into that position, but it looks painful.  A fun shot, that if you know the kids, I''m sure they''d love to have a copy!  Good catch of the ball and everything! Not extremely exciting but a nice solid sports shot.  -8-', '2003-09-19 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(424456, 37763, 9168, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, but the ball is a little washed out.</td>', 'Funny idea, but the ball is a little washed out.', '2003-09-20 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
