(424465, 37426, 9168, '<td valign="top">Looks like it took a wicked turn.</td>', 'Looks like it took a wicked turn.', '2003-09-20 00:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424562, 37697, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice catch with both players on the different sides in midair.  I think I would have zoomed in quite a bit closer and made this a vertical shot to include just the two players and the ball... I think this would have had more impact and would have kept the viewers eyes where they should be, where the action is.  As it is I think there is too much going on here.  IMHO of course.  It bothers me that you can''t see either of the two main players face''s but thats hard in volleyball.  Nice action though, and pretty good color.</td>', 'Nice catch with both players on the different sides in midair.  I think I would have zoomed in quite a bit closer and made this a vertical shot to include just the two players and the ball... I think this would have had more impact and would have kept the viewers eyes where they should be, where the action is.  As it is I think there is too much going on here.  IMHO of course.  It bothers me that you can''t see either of the two main players face''s but thats hard in volleyball.  Nice action though, and pretty good color.', '2003-09-20 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424563, 37417, 8953, '<td valign="top">This was just "BAM" to me. I love this shot. you located the young man so well, his clothing is a nice contrast to the rest of the image. Your use of B&amp;W and the overall tone was just a part of all that works for me. The DOF, again was also done very well. I may not do the best job taken shots but I think I know when I see when someone else has. 10...10...10!</td>', 'This was just "BAM" to me. I love this shot. you located the young man so well, his clothing is a nice contrast to the rest of the image. Your use of B&W and the overall tone was just a part of all that works for me. The DOF, again was also done very well. I may not do the best job taken shots but I think I know when I see when someone else has. 10...10...10!', '2003-09-20 03:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(424564, 37007, 8953, '<td valign="top">Let the picture be the thousand words!:) its a good shot. and I trust it was not staged. Very nice DOF and good action capture. Good Luck. 9</td>', 'Let the picture be the thousand words!:) its a good shot. and I trust it was not staged. Very nice DOF and good action capture. Good Luck. 9', '2003-09-20 03:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424566, 37717, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few better known sports that I''ve never shot but would like to.  Good action here, wish I could have seen either the front of the horse, or more of the person, and I wish you would have gotten the person completely in the frame.  Also I would have cropped off as tight as possible from the bottom and the left side.  I''m guessing you took this from pretty far away and couldn''t zoom in too much?  I would have liked to have seen more of the person and maybe even less of the horse.  but good try...</td>', 'This is one of the few better known sports that I''ve never shot but would like to.  Good action here, wish I could have seen either the front of the horse, or more of the person, and I wish you would have gotten the person completely in the frame.  Also I would have cropped off as tight as possible from the bottom and the left side.  I''m guessing you took this from pretty far away and couldn''t zoom in too much?  I would have liked to have seen more of the person and maybe even less of the horse.  but good try...', '2003-09-20 03:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(424568, 37825, 8953, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job of capturing this sport! would have liked this even more without the distractions in the background...but I am sure you have heard this a least twice before now:) still I like 7</td>', 'I think you did a great job of capturing this sport! would have liked this even more without the distractions in the background...but I am sure you have heard this a least twice before now:) still I like 7', '2003-09-20 03:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(424569, 37760, 4967, '<td valign="top">Bocci ball?  This is really interesting, not sure what you did here to get the outcome you got.  I think it is pretty cool actually.  A very artistic look at the sport, which I like, no one said sports had to be a straight on action person to person, background blurred shot :-)  This is very cool, I love the black and white, and you can just kind of see whats happening without having to see the front of the people.  I''m going to go out on a limb here and give this a -10- because it is so unique and interesting.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Bocci ball?  This is really interesting, not sure what you did here to get the outcome you got.  I think it is pretty cool actually.  A very artistic look at the sport, which I like, no one said sports had to be a straight on action person to person, background blurred shot :-)  This is very cool, I love the black and white, and you can just kind of see whats happening without having to see the front of the people.  I''m going to go out on a limb here and give this a -10- because it is so unique and interesting.  Nicely done!', '2003-09-20 03:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424570, 37594, 4967, '<td valign="top">Not sure where you had the chance to see this, but very cool :-)  I like how you made it older looking by putting it in sepia... very cool.  Good composition... wish the horse wasn''t completely in shadows though, but I''m guessing this couldn''t be helped... Is this one of those dinner places the knights castles or whatever.  Pretty cool</td>', 'Not sure where you had the chance to see this, but very cool :-)  I like how you made it older looking by putting it in sepia... very cool.  Good composition... wish the horse wasn''t completely in shadows though, but I''m guessing this couldn''t be helped... Is this one of those dinner places the knights castles or whatever.  Pretty cool', '2003-09-20 03:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(424572, 37733, 8953, '<td valign="top">More of the horse and rider would have punched up this shot. I see the light was coming in from the left. would have been nice to have caught more of the light hitting the horse to help set it and the rider off. the light coming in overthe grand stand is a bit harsh and washed out part of the image as well. I may have said to much, but know I still think this image has merit and is a fresh shot for the sport challenge. 6</td>', 'More of the horse and rider would have punched up this shot. I see the light was coming in from the left. would have been nice to have caught more of the light hitting the horse to help set it and the rider off. the light coming in overthe grand stand is a bit harsh and washed out part of the image as well. I may have said to much, but know I still think this image has merit and is a fresh shot for the sport challenge. 6', '2003-09-20 03:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(424573, 37568, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here of having the other table going off to the upper left, it gives a feeling that maybe there are a bunch of other pool tables.  Nice action as well... very well done capturing the movemtn and everything, having the persons hand in there was a good idea... overall this is just a very nicely done shot, with great lighting and great capture.  I''m goiing to give this a -10- congrats and good luck!</td>', 'I love the composition here of having the other table going off to the upper left, it gives a feeling that maybe there are a bunch of other pool tables.  Nice action as well... very well done capturing the movemtn and everything, having the persons hand in there was a good idea... overall this is just a very nicely done shot, with great lighting and great capture.  I''m goiing to give this a -10- congrats and good luck!', '2003-09-20 03:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(424574, 37134, 4967, '<td valign="top">Did he jump off a cliff and are you shooting this from the cliff?  Beautiful sight, I''d love to do that some day!  I wish you could have zoomed in quite a bit more, and filled the frame with the person and and hang glider.... but if you didn''t have access to a zoom thats understandable.  I just think as a sports shot this would have been more applicable if you could see the exuberance on the persons face.  Since you couldn''t I still would have tried maybe to crop differently as it is the hangglider just sits in the middle of the frame... not very attractively done composition wise.</td>', 'Did he jump off a cliff and are you shooting this from the cliff?  Beautiful sight, I''d love to do that some day!  I wish you could have zoomed in quite a bit more, and filled the frame with the person and and hang glider.... but if you didn''t have access to a zoom thats understandable.  I just think as a sports shot this would have been more applicable if you could see the exuberance on the persons face.  Since you couldn''t I still would have tried maybe to crop differently as it is the hangglider just sits in the middle of the frame... not very attractively done composition wise.', '2003-09-20 03:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424575, 37685, 8953, '<td valign="top">Off with his head! Have your heard this more than you care too? taken a shot like this requires a steady hand, a fast lens and lots of light. that you did this well is great! if you had been able to take this shot more from the front( I see that is where the light is coming from) you might have managed a better freeze on the action. nice try:) hope I helped. 5</td>', 'Off with his head! Have your heard this more than you care too? taken a shot like this requires a steady hand, a fast lens and lots of light. that you did this well is great! if you had been able to take this shot more from the front( I see that is where the light is coming from) you might have managed a better freeze on the action. nice try:) hope I helped. 5', '2003-09-20 03:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424577, 37655, 8953, '<td valign="top">Hope he missed the camera...:) the contrast and saturation on this shot needed to be played with a bit. and I would have liked to see the ball a little distance from the edge of the picture. 6</td>', 'Hope he missed the camera...:) the contrast and saturation on this shot needed to be played with a bit. and I would have liked to see the ball a little distance from the edge of the picture. 6', '2003-09-20 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(424578, 37807, 8953, '<td valign="top">nice shot! good focus. clear subject. nice stop action and color.9</td>', 'nice shot! good focus. clear subject. nice stop action and color.9', '2003-09-20 03:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424579, 37596, 8953, '<td valign="top">hold that pose while I grab my camera! Nice action take. Colors, focus and lighting are super. If I could have one wish it would be to have keft the whole shadow as well...still good job.9</td>', 'hold that pose while I grab my camera! Nice action take. Colors, focus and lighting are super. If I could have one wish it would be to have keft the whole shadow as well...still good job.9', '2003-09-20 03:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424580, 37426, 8953, '<td valign="top">now if you could teach me the trick of putting a whole in one and then making it over to the camera and catching the moment so sharply...I will share my winnings with you:) heck! I would let you keep the jacket too! Nice shot, great focus and light. 9</td>', 'now if you could teach me the trick of putting a whole in one and then making it over to the camera and catching the moment so sharply...I will share my winnings with you:) heck! I would let you keep the jacket too! Nice shot, great focus and light. 9', '2003-09-20 03:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(424581, 37417, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a cute interpretation of the challenge, and it does have to do with sports, although there isn''t much action being caught here, I like the feeling that this boy is out, while the others are in, and it tells the story of how sports are for young kids.  I liked your composition a lot, and I feel that black and white was the right choice for this photo.  Not extremely exciting but nice all the same.</td>', 'This is a cute interpretation of the challenge, and it does have to do with sports, although there isn''t much action being caught here, I like the feeling that this boy is out, while the others are in, and it tells the story of how sports are for young kids.  I liked your composition a lot, and I feel that black and white was the right choice for this photo.  Not extremely exciting but nice all the same.', '2003-09-20 04:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(424582, 37648, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice job of getting up for a closer look of the athlete, this helps us to connect more.  Good DOF.  Not much action happening here, looks like he''s running but not for any purpose that we can tell.. His face doesn''t really tell us anything either, but it''s still a nice close up.</td>', 'Nice job of getting up for a closer look of the athlete, this helps us to connect more.  Good DOF.  Not much action happening here, looks like he''s running but not for any purpose that we can tell.. His face doesn''t really tell us anything either, but it''s still a nice close up.', '2003-09-20 04:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(424583, 37708, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wish you would have had a longer zoom to catch more of the action closer up.  This is a great subject though :-)  It''s just too far away for a great sports shot.  but it''s a nice boating scene.</td>', 'Wish you would have had a longer zoom to catch more of the action closer up.  This is a great subject though :-)  It''s just too far away for a great sports shot.  but it''s a nice boating scene.', '2003-09-20 04:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(424584, 37748, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is cute, wish there was a puck somewhere and it didn''t look like he was just skating around the ice.  Would have been nice to zoom in quite a bit more and get right up in his face, maybe even let us see what he''s thinking.  I think I would have liked the picture to be more straight, it''s tilted as you can tell by the board running around the rink... Other then that not too bad...</td>', 'This is cute, wish there was a puck somewhere and it didn''t look like he was just skating around the ice.  Would have been nice to zoom in quite a bit more and get right up in his face, maybe even let us see what he''s thinking.  I think I would have liked the picture to be more straight, it''s tilted as you can tell by the board running around the rink... Other then that not too bad...', '2003-09-20 04:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(424585, 37042, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love barrel racing, I''ve done it a little myself!  I think for this though I would have liked to have seen the horse bending around the barrel coming towards us instead of going away from us.  As it is I can''t see the expression on the womans face which bothers me.  Also I just don''t feel to much in this setting, would like to have a closer view of the woman, maybe crop off some of the extraneous dirt.  Good action here though :-).</td>', 'I love barrel racing, I''ve done it a little myself!  I think for this though I would have liked to have seen the horse bending around the barrel coming towards us instead of going away from us.  As it is I can''t see the expression on the womans face which bothers me.  Also I just don''t feel to much in this setting, would like to have a closer view of the woman, maybe crop off some of the extraneous dirt.  Good action here though :-).', '2003-09-20 04:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424588, 37842, 8953, '<td valign="top">Well I have gone through most of the images and this is one of only a couple I call Ten! your use of light and movement created ART! I had thought of this very idea....that being said my shot would not have been as nice as this. colors, light, DOF.ect ect...again a ten! good luck:)</td>', 'Well I have gone through most of the images and this is one of only a couple I call Ten! your use of light and movement created ART! I had thought of this very idea....that being said my shot would not have been as nice as this. colors, light, DOF.ect ect...again a ten! good luck:)', '2003-09-20 04:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(424590, 37417, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fine image and story. <br/>One tip I will give you though (if you are using photoshop) is not to change the mode of your photo to grayscale but leave it in RGB. Go into the Image - Adjustments - Channel Mixer menu, select "monochrome" and start moving around the sliding cursors until you get an optimal range of grays. In this image the lawn texture and tone would be improved a lot by darkenig in the green channel.<br/> I am sure this will eventually make sense to you.</td>', 'Fine image and story. One tip I will give you though (if you are using photoshop) is not to change the mode of your photo to grayscale but leave it in RGB. Go into the Image - Adjustments - Channel Mixer menu, select "monochrome" and start moving around the sliding cursors until you get an optimal range of grays. In this image the lawn texture and tone would be improved a lot by darkenig in the green channel. I am sure this will eventually make sense to you.', '2003-09-20 04:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(424592, 37760, 3585, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the spacial awkwardness, and mystery in this one. Does one have to be Brithish to make some sense about what is goig on?</td>', 'I like the composition, the spacial awkwardness, and mystery in this one. Does one have to be Brithish to make some sense about what is goig on?', '2003-09-20 05:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(424595, 37616, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice staging. A good cadidate for B&amp;W. would put the umbrella and the lawn in the same tonal range. this would improve the balance of the composition. Would also add a little extra mood in this fine rainy day image.</td>', 'Nice staging. A good cadidate for B&W. would put the umbrella and the lawn in the same tonal range. this would improve the balance of the composition. Would also add a little extra mood in this fine rainy day image.', '2003-09-20 05:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(424627, 37615, 11073, '<td valign="top">compositionally its a good shot.  I think that what''s missing for me is the play.  I can see the QB dropping back to what looks like hand the ball off ( or play action ) but I can''t see the running back or imo "the key players" in the play.  The O&amp;D lines are important to any football play...but their not the high profile positions - I guess my point is, its a good shot - and I''ll score it well because it deserves it - but I hope it doesn''t suffer from not having key elements in it - i think thats why my "minds eye" didn''t score it so high at first.</td>', 'compositionally its a good shot.  I think that what''s missing for me is the play.  I can see the QB dropping back to what looks like hand the ball off ( or play action ) but I can''t see the running back or imo "the key players" in the play.  The O&D lines are important to any football play...but their not the high profile positions - I guess my point is, its a good shot - and I''ll score it well because it deserves it - but I hope it doesn''t suffer from not having key elements in it - i think thats why my "minds eye" didn''t score it so high at first.', '2003-09-20 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424628, 37330, 11073, '<td valign="top">great chess shot.  the movement of the pawn is great...wish i knew how you did it!  The lighting is good too - I can''t tell if I like the fact that the queen is brighter than all the other pieces.  nice work.</td>', 'great chess shot.  the movement of the pawn is great...wish i knew how you did it!  The lighting is good too - I can''t tell if I like the fact that the queen is brighter than all the other pieces.  nice work.', '2003-09-20 11:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(424636, 37552, 12108, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the contrast between the redclay and the grass  really draws your in,. Great shot</td>', 'Great colors, the contrast between the redclay and the grass  really draws your in,. Great shot', '2003-09-20 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424659, 37801, 7969, '<td valign="top">I suspect folks will tell you this is not a sport, but I think it is a great shot, the curve of the smoke and the blue color are freat, it is a clean shot, the light is hitting the back of plane and smoke area nicely too.  Well done.</td>', 'I suspect folks will tell you this is not a sport, but I think it is a great shot, the curve of the smoke and the blue color are freat, it is a clean shot, the light is hitting the back of plane and smoke area nicely too.  Well done.', '2003-09-20 13:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(424662, 37563, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good capture, with the ball being just off  the ground, good work on the DOF, I took some similar shots that just did nt work. Your shot is clear and showing movement, not easy, well done.</td>', 'Good capture, with the ball being just off  the ground, good work on the DOF, I took some similar shots that just did nt work. Your shot is clear and showing movement, not easy, well done.', '2003-09-20 13:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(424664, 37825, 7969, '<td valign="top">Did well to freeze the ''action'' while blurring the background.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Did well to freeze the ''action'' while blurring the background.  Nice shot.', '2003-09-20 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424700, 37563, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite the blurring (possibly because of low light) this shot captures what is necessary - the competitive spirit of hockey. The key elements are sharp and crisp with good expressions of determination on the faces, good composition and interesting DOF. This deserves to do well.</td>', 'Despite the blurring (possibly because of low light) this shot captures what is necessary - the competitive spirit of hockey. The key elements are sharp and crisp with good expressions of determination on the faces, good composition and interesting DOF. This deserves to do well.', '2003-09-20 15:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(424701, 37685, 8860, '<td valign="top">This composition draws the viewer into the bike itself rather than the sport. The image itself is too blurred which may be down to low light/slow shutter speed. The cropping is off-putting because the detail of the bike is not clear.</td>', 'This composition draws the viewer into the bike itself rather than the sport. The image itself is too blurred which may be down to low light/slow shutter speed. The cropping is off-putting because the detail of the bike is not clear.', '2003-09-20 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(424704, 37783, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really can''t comment on this because I think the image has errored in upload or something. If it''s meant to look like their faces and the ball are made of a graduated tone, then I have to say that it''s a gross error of judgement instead. On what I see (and I''ve screen-grabbed it just in case)- I have to vote this 1. Sorry.</td>', 'I really can''t comment on this because I think the image has errored in upload or something. If it''s meant to look like their faces and the ball are made of a graduated tone, then I have to say that it''s a gross error of judgement instead. On what I see (and I''ve screen-grabbed it just in case)- I have to vote this 1. Sorry.', '2003-09-20 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(424705, 37007, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I have to subtract a point for giving too much info in your title. The picture stands alone by itself. You don''t need to tell us its not cropped or posed. Would have been a 8 now a 7. Great shot though.</td>', 'Great shot but I have to subtract a point for giving too much info in your title. The picture stands alone by itself. You don''t need to tell us its not cropped or posed. Would have been a 8 now a 7. Great shot though.', '2003-09-20 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424708, 37760, 8860, '<td valign="top">Bizarre! Very dynamic use of mono, but I''m not convinced that this is a good sporting picture. It''s creative in technique and composition but I find myself frustrated at the lack of context. I won''t forget it though.</td>', 'Bizarre! Very dynamic use of mono, but I''m not convinced that this is a good sporting picture. It''s creative in technique and composition but I find myself frustrated at the lack of context. I won''t forget it though.', '2003-09-20 15:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(424718, 37471, 8860, '<td valign="top">Hey - that''s cheating! You''re not supposed to take your hands off the handles or spin, etc., etc..<br/> <br/>Cool shot of a fun take on the challenge. Good angle, lighting and clarity. Nice, clean shot. [7]</td>', 'Hey - that''s cheating! You''re not supposed to take your hands off the handles or spin, etc., etc.. Cool shot of a fun take on the challenge. Good angle, lighting and clarity. Nice, clean shot. [7]', '2003-09-20 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424720, 37812, 8860, '<td valign="top">You mean she hides in the pin-bay of a bowling alley? Bad luck mate. ;)<br/> <br/>Nice clean shot - slightly tilted though. It''s a shame you couldn''t have got an action shot of the ball with pins being knocked over.</td>', 'You mean she hides in the pin-bay of a bowling alley? Bad luck mate. ;) Nice clean shot - slightly tilted though. It''s a shame you couldn''t have got an action shot of the ball with pins being knocked over.', '2003-09-20 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(424721, 37576, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Shot is a bit noisy and the boat spoils the simplicity of the shot though. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice capture. Shot is a bit noisy and the boat spoils the simplicity of the shot though. Good composition.', '2003-09-20 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(424737, 37842, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The movement of the pedal gives the shot a lot of dynamic. Gives it great movement. I like how the pedal and the foot is blurred but everything else like the frame is perfectly focused.<br/>Might make a great ad for "Shimano" too.</td>', 'Great composition. The movement of the pedal gives the shot a lot of dynamic. Gives it great movement. I like how the pedal and the foot is blurred but everything else like the frame is perfectly focused.Might make a great ad for "Shimano" too.', '2003-09-20 18:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(424740, 37594, 10084, '<td valign="top">Ye olde sports. Great theme and composition. I like how you captured the shadow on the left side of the picture and the light on the right. Kind of gives it the dark knight vs. the good knight. Very yinyang-ish.<br/>The angle helps with the composition. It brings your eyes toward the center with the help of the pertition in the middle.<br/> I like the sephia, but it would be interesting to see this in color also. Usually the knights are wearing really beautiful bright colors.</td>', 'Ye olde sports. Great theme and composition. I like how you captured the shadow on the left side of the picture and the light on the right. Kind of gives it the dark knight vs. the good knight. Very yinyang-ish.The angle helps with the composition. It brings your eyes toward the center with the help of the pertition in the middle. I like the sephia, but it would be interesting to see this in color also. Usually the knights are wearing really beautiful bright colors.', '2003-09-20 18:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424741, 37652, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. It shows a great dynamic movement in the picture. The composition is very interesting. The depth of field is good. The guy looks like he might pop out of the picture.</td>', 'Great action shot. It shows a great dynamic movement in the picture. The composition is very interesting. The depth of field is good. The guy looks like he might pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-20 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(424743, 37812, 10084, '<td valign="top">The title is interesting. "Where my wife spends most of her time" at the alley or in the gutter. lol.<br/> <br/>Good composition. I like that you used a vertical composition. Gives you a sense of the length of the alley. Needs to be straightened a little bit. You were able to capture some really nice colors. I like how the reflections are very vivid. Usually bowling alleys have bad lighting, but you were able to get a great shot here.</td>', 'The title is interesting. "Where my wife spends most of her time" at the alley or in the gutter. lol. Good composition. I like that you used a vertical composition. Gives you a sense of the length of the alley. Needs to be straightened a little bit. You were able to capture some really nice colors. I like how the reflections are very vivid. Usually bowling alleys have bad lighting, but you were able to get a great shot here.', '2003-09-20 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(424744, 37417, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very emotive picture.Beautiful composition. The depth of field is incredible. I like how the boy is wearing black and your eyes automatically focus on him. It really brings him to the foreground. This is definitely a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Very emotive picture.Beautiful composition. The depth of field is incredible. I like how the boy is wearing black and your eyes automatically focus on him. It really brings him to the foreground. This is definitely a ribbon winner.', '2003-09-20 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(424752, 37265, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect. This would make for a great Gatorade commercial. I like the dynamic movement in the shot. Really shows the action.</td>', 'Very cool effect. This would make for a great Gatorade commercial. I like the dynamic movement in the shot. Really shows the action.', '2003-09-20 19:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(424753, 37524, 8860, '<td valign="top">25 ring I think! Nice composition. A bit noisy but a good idea and it''s well captured if a bit of a wobbly throw.</td>', '25 ring I think! Nice composition. A bit noisy but a good idea and it''s well captured if a bit of a wobbly throw.', '2003-09-20 19:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(424758, 37524, 12397, '<td valign="top">Very nice! A little bit grainy - but it''s not very bad.</td>', 'Very nice! A little bit grainy - but it''s not very bad.', '2003-09-20 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(424767, 37616, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a familiar view that will be for me in a few years time! Nice idea and execution, which captures the essence of the game and situation very well. It''s a bit wonky though so I would have straightened it up along the line of filed/horizon.</td>', 'What a familiar view that will be for me in a few years time! Nice idea and execution, which captures the essence of the game and situation very well. It''s a bit wonky though so I would have straightened it up along the line of filed/horizon.', '2003-09-20 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(424769, 37736, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture with good composition. Focus is crisp and lighting is good (despite the lack of strong sun).</td>', 'Excellent capture with good composition. Focus is crisp and lighting is good (despite the lack of strong sun).', '2003-09-20 20:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(424770, 36920, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture - focus is a bit soft on surfers though. Waves are very impressive. Good composition.</td>', 'Great capture - focus is a bit soft on surfers though. Waves are very impressive. Good composition.', '2003-09-20 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(424772, 37613, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and DOF. Very crisp and clear with a nice touch of action and dust motion. Excellent.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and DOF. Very crisp and clear with a nice touch of action and dust motion. Excellent.', '2003-09-20 20:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(424773, 37801, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this. Colours are punchy and vivid. My only criticism is that the plane is side on with not much detail/form to latch on to. If it were 3/4 turned it would be perfect. I suppose it''s a sport, but it''s not in the Olympics I don''t think ;)<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a great capture.</td>', 'I love the composition of this. Colours are punchy and vivid. My only criticism is that the plane is side on with not much detail/form to latch on to. If it were 3/4 turned it would be perfect. I suppose it''s a sport, but it''s not in the Olympics I don''t think ;) Anyway, it''s a great capture.', '2003-09-20 20:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(424827, 37563, 778, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the action...colors, lighting, compositon excellent!  A great job!</td>', 'Great focus on the action...colors, lighting, compositon excellent!  A great job!', '2003-09-20 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(424880, 37471, 10084, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition. Love the angle that you use, very interesting. Great shadows and reflections on the table. The blurring of the kickers gives a great point of interest and action. The ball flying in the air makes for a dynamic picture. Beautiful colors in the peace.</td>', 'Really like the composition. Love the angle that you use, very interesting. Great shadows and reflections on the table. The blurring of the kickers gives a great point of interest and action. The ball flying in the air makes for a dynamic picture. Beautiful colors in the peace.', '2003-09-21 01:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(424899, 37812, 9146, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this either tilted to a greater degree or straight as it is it doesn''t look like it''s on purpose also a wider angle lens might have given this more depth</td>', 'I would have liked this either tilted to a greater degree or straight as it is it doesn''t look like it''s on purpose also a wider angle lens might have given this more depth', '2003-09-21 02:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(424902, 37576, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good catch, to me it looks almost like he''s holding onto the boat.  I like how this photo was taken around sundown, it gives it a nice soft look.  Nice job getting the surfer at the peak of the action.  The horizon looks slightly tilted but it''s not a big deal.  I wish you would have gotten closer, but I realize you probably had limitations on zooming.</td>', 'Good catch, to me it looks almost like he''s holding onto the boat.  I like how this photo was taken around sundown, it gives it a nice soft look.  Nice job getting the surfer at the peak of the action.  The horizon looks slightly tilted but it''s not a big deal.  I wish you would have gotten closer, but I realize you probably had limitations on zooming.', '2003-09-21 02:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424903, 37613, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very clear, good action shot.  It bothers me that the girl who is in focus has her back to you, but it''s not terrible.  I like the determination on the girl who is looking straight at the camera''s face.  I almost wish she was in focus and the girl with the ball was a little blurry, might have made for a pretty interesting shot.  Field hockey is fun to shoot though :-)  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very clear, good action shot.  It bothers me that the girl who is in focus has her back to you, but it''s not terrible.  I like the determination on the girl who is looking straight at the camera''s face.  I almost wish she was in focus and the girl with the ball was a little blurry, might have made for a pretty interesting shot.  Field hockey is fun to shoot though :-)  Nicely done.', '2003-09-21 02:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(424904, 37852, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting... this might have been very cool for another challenge, but for me it''s really not a sports shot, although it''s definitely related to sports.  I love your title though, very very clever :-)  Interesting lighting at the very top... I think I would have liked maybe a ball coming in from the side or something, just to give it some action... but thats just me.</td>', 'Interesting... this might have been very cool for another challenge, but for me it''s really not a sports shot, although it''s definitely related to sports.  I love your title though, very very clever :-)  Interesting lighting at the very top... I think I would have liked maybe a ball coming in from the side or something, just to give it some action... but thats just me.', '2003-09-21 02:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(424905, 37643, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the blur that shows where the action is.  I feel as though the actual action is kind of weird though, for one, I don''t see anyone taking the guy down (maybe he is tripping, but I don''t know...) also the way that his body is positioned, I can''t tell but it looks like he doesn''t have a left arm?  I''m not keen on your cropping, although I don''t know how I would have done it differently, the guy on the right is exxtremely distracting (the one headed out of the photo)  Good job getting the ball in the photo, but there is just something that doesn''t look right to me here...</td>', 'I like the blur that shows where the action is.  I feel as though the actual action is kind of weird though, for one, I don''t see anyone taking the guy down (maybe he is tripping, but I don''t know...) also the way that his body is positioned, I can''t tell but it looks like he doesn''t have a left arm?  I''m not keen on your cropping, although I don''t know how I would have done it differently, the guy on the right is exxtremely distracting (the one headed out of the photo)  Good job getting the ball in the photo, but there is just something that doesn''t look right to me here...', '2003-09-21 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(424906, 37743, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subjects, I would never have thought of this as a sport, but definitely it can be taken as one.  Did you use a flash here?  it looks extremely harsh on her face and hair.  The positioning she is in bothers me, and doesn''t really make for a very interesting photo IMHO.  There is a tiny bit of action with her putting the mouthpiece in her mouth, but not really anything else.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subjects, I would never have thought of this as a sport, but definitely it can be taken as one.  Did you use a flash here?  it looks extremely harsh on her face and hair.  The positioning she is in bothers me, and doesn''t really make for a very interesting photo IMHO.  There is a tiny bit of action with her putting the mouthpiece in her mouth, but not really anything else.', '2003-09-21 02:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(424907, 37493, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very fun!  I love go karts... I wish there was another racer near this one, as I think it would have given more of a sense of action then just riding around the track on a cart.  I think it would have been cool to have two in the photo.  I think I would have cropped out at least some of the right side of the photo as well as some of the bottom.  Also wish I could have seen some reaction on the kids face, but it probably wasn''t possible.</td>', 'Very fun!  I love go karts... I wish there was another racer near this one, as I think it would have given more of a sense of action then just riding around the track on a cart.  I think it would have been cool to have two in the photo.  I think I would have cropped out at least some of the right side of the photo as well as some of the bottom.  Also wish I could have seen some reaction on the kids face, but it probably wasn''t possible.', '2003-09-21 02:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(424910, 37825, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is very well done, I love the sense of action and the two people in the background.  I also absolutely love the shadow from the bike!  Great composition here, overall just extremely well done.  I''m going to go ahead and give you the -10- I think you deserve :-)</td>', 'This is very well done, I love the sense of action and the two people in the background.  I also absolutely love the shadow from the bike!  Great composition here, overall just extremely well done.  I''m going to go ahead and give you the -10- I think you deserve :-)', '2003-09-21 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(424916, 37802, 10187, '<td valign="top">excellent shot!</td>', 'excellent shot!', '2003-09-21 03:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(424918, 37495, 9146, '<td valign="top">there''s something wrong with the puload on you pic on my computer. it looks like it''s not fully loaded.  (extreemy blurry) I tryed using another broser and that didn''t help. I didn''t vote on your pic but if this is a problem in the system and not just my computer others migt not be so kind. from the tumbnail which is clear this looks like a really great shot.</td>', 'there''s something wrong with the puload on you pic on my computer. it looks like it''s not fully loaded.  (extreemy blurry) I tryed using another broser and that didn''t help. I didn''t vote on your pic but if this is a problem in the system and not just my computer others migt not be so kind. from the tumbnail which is clear this looks like a really great shot.', '2003-09-21 03:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(424919, 37715, 11942, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea of taking the picture from behind the net, however I feel that the bottom half of the picture is not needed. I feel that if you cropped the picture from the shadow line just below the net, it would bring the viewers eyes to the football game. In this case because the shadow below the net is a darker contrast than the subject, the eye is drawn to the shadow.</td>', 'I really like your idea of taking the picture from behind the net, however I feel that the bottom half of the picture is not needed. I feel that if you cropped the picture from the shadow line just below the net, it would bring the viewers eyes to the football game. In this case because the shadow below the net is a darker contrast than the subject, the eye is drawn to the shadow.', '2003-09-21 03:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(424921, 37759, 11942, '<td valign="top">For me this picture is outstanding! very good! Just a small suggestion though: I feel that if you moved one pawn (for example the white pawn in front of the King) forward one space, it would have been a better "action" shot effect than just having the game in its basic set up.</td>', 'For me this picture is outstanding! very good! Just a small suggestion though: I feel that if you moved one pawn (for example the white pawn in front of the King) forward one space, it would have been a better "action" shot effect than just having the game in its basic set up.', '2003-09-21 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(424931, 37596, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Looks like the dogs posing. The reflection of the eye looks like its looking right at the camera. Love the beautiful shadow on the grass. The colors of the dog really bright forward out of the picture. Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Great action shot. Looks like the dogs posing. The reflection of the eye looks like its looking right at the camera. Love the beautiful shadow on the grass. The colors of the dog really bright forward out of the picture. Beautiful composition.', '2003-09-21 07:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424963, 37648, 5225, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific photograph.</td>', 'This is a terrific photograph.', '2003-09-21 10:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(424976, 37840, 11769, '<td valign="top">Does anyone ever win at this?</td>', 'Does anyone ever win at this?', '2003-09-21 12:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(424979, 37810, 11769, '<td valign="top">Is this what we have become?</td>', 'Is this what we have become?', '2003-09-21 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(424980, 37763, 11769, '<td valign="top">Golf ball appears blown out. I''ve been there though.</td>', 'Golf ball appears blown out. I''ve been there though.', '2003-09-21 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(424989, 37616, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is cute, nice DOF with getting the umbrella in focus as well as the players.  I like how you frame the game with the umbrella.  I would have liked to have seen your shutter speed just a bit higher maybe, because the main boy doesn''t look to be in focus, but I''m guessing he''s just blurry.  I think you could have cropped out the two playerss on the left and still had the same effect.  Tighter is often better in sports shots.</td>', 'This is cute, nice DOF with getting the umbrella in focus as well as the players.  I like how you frame the game with the umbrella.  I would have liked to have seen your shutter speed just a bit higher maybe, because the main boy doesn''t look to be in focus, but I''m guessing he''s just blurry.  I think you could have cropped out the two playerss on the left and still had the same effect.  Tighter is often better in sports shots.', '2003-09-21 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(424991, 37684, 4967, '<td valign="top">I wish you could see this a little closer, but I realize there were probably zoom limitations.  I think I would have liked a little more action as well, maybe some water coming off the oar, or more of a pathway where the boat had been... it looks to be moving rather slowly.  Good subject though...</td>', 'I wish you could see this a little closer, but I realize there were probably zoom limitations.  I think I would have liked a little more action as well, maybe some water coming off the oar, or more of a pathway where the boat had been... it looks to be moving rather slowly.  Good subject though...', '2003-09-21 13:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(424992, 37524, 4967, '<td valign="top">There''s lots of noise in this photo... which isn''t altogether bad, but I''m guessing you had a pretty high ISO?  Nice movement in the dart... too bad it''s not exactly a bulls-eye (or is it?) hard to tell.  The line at the top, which I''m guessing is part of the wall is rather distracting... I think you could have achieved the same photo by cropping out some of the top, at the same time not putting the main subject directly center for a better rule of thirds look.</td>', 'There''s lots of noise in this photo... which isn''t altogether bad, but I''m guessing you had a pretty high ISO?  Nice movement in the dart... too bad it''s not exactly a bulls-eye (or is it?) hard to tell.  The line at the top, which I''m guessing is part of the wall is rather distracting... I think you could have achieved the same photo by cropping out some of the top, at the same time not putting the main subject directly center for a better rule of thirds look.', '2003-09-21 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(424993, 37801, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very Cool subject.  I would have made this more of a vertical photo, and cropped out some of the extraneous blue on the left, right and tops of the photos.  This also would have helped with composition which is rather bland here with the subject almost directly in the middle.  I like your cach here a lot!  I''m wondering whether you used a polarizing filter or not... that is one VERY blue sky!</td>', 'Very Cool subject.  I would have made this more of a vertical photo, and cropped out some of the extraneous blue on the left, right and tops of the photos.  This also would have helped with composition which is rather bland here with the subject almost directly in the middle.  I like your cach here a lot!  I''m wondering whether you used a polarizing filter or not... that is one VERY blue sky!', '2003-09-21 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(424997, 36920, 10867, '<td valign="top">Thae photograph shows lots of action and coveys both the idea of competition and the power of the water well.  There are a few little hotspots, but I don''t see how they could have been avoided under the circumstances.</td>', 'Thae photograph shows lots of action and coveys both the idea of competition and the power of the water well.  There are a few little hotspots, but I don''t see how they could have been avoided under the circumstances.', '2003-09-21 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(425004, 37568, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lots of implied motion in this image.  I''m not sure that the choice of perspective is ideal, however.  Also, because the balls are so scattered, so is our attention.  Our eyes are pulled in several different directions.</td>', 'Lots of implied motion in this image.  I''m not sure that the choice of perspective is ideal, however.  Also, because the balls are so scattered, so is our attention.  Our eyes are pulled in several different directions.', '2003-09-21 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(425005, 37748, 10867, '<td valign="top">Nice, frozen movement shot of the young player, presumably at a practice.  I like the choice of perspective.  I think I''d like more space, though, between the skater and the bottom of the frame so that he had more room to skate into.  I have no objection to the slanted yellow edge of the rink.  It adds to a sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice, frozen movement shot of the young player, presumably at a practice.  I like the choice of perspective.  I think I''d like more space, though, between the skater and the bottom of the frame so that he had more room to skate into.  I have no objection to the slanted yellow edge of the rink.  It adds to a sense of movement.', '2003-09-21 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(425007, 37708, 10867, '<td valign="top">Definitely a sports them, with a real feeling of competition.  Good sharpness from front to back, too.  However, the preponderance of straight lines parallel to the top and bottom frames and the lack of any motion blurs or much other evidence of motion give the image a slightly static quality IMHO.</td>', 'Definitely a sports them, with a real feeling of competition.  Good sharpness from front to back, too.  However, the preponderance of straight lines parallel to the top and bottom frames and the lack of any motion blurs or much other evidence of motion give the image a slightly static quality IMHO.', '2003-09-21 14:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(425010, 37743, 10867, '<td valign="top">Interesting, clear, sharp and frame filling!  It''s also very clear from the equipment she''s using and the "dive" printed on her shoulder strap exactly what sport the model is engaged in.  Nice composition and colours, too.</td>', 'Interesting, clear, sharp and frame filling!  It''s also very clear from the equipment she''s using and the "dive" printed on her shoulder strap exactly what sport the model is engaged in.  Nice composition and colours, too.', '2003-09-21 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(425012, 37596, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!  Arguably, "dog frisbee" might not qualify as a sport.  To me, though, this image definitely shows the essence of sport--energetic physical movement, intense focus on the object of the game by the player(s).  The action is beautifully caught in this image and the composition and colour are excellent.  We can feel the dog''s intent concentration and see the muscle strain.  Great timing for this shot and great use of light and shadow.  Yes, I like this one a lot!</td>', 'Very, very nice!  Arguably, "dog frisbee" might not qualify as a sport.  To me, though, this image definitely shows the essence of sport--energetic physical movement, intense focus on the object of the game by the player(s).  The action is beautifully caught in this image and the composition and colour are excellent.  We can feel the dog''s intent concentration and see the muscle strain.  Great timing for this shot and great use of light and shadow.  Yes, I like this one a lot!', '2003-09-21 14:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(425015, 37580, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lots of action and excellent, sharp focus on the two players in the left foreground.  I also love the position of the ball and the motion blur on it.  I''m not sure about the player bursting into the frame from the left.  It does add action, but I think I''d prefer it not to be there.  Without it, the composition would be perfectly balanced.</td>', 'Lots of action and excellent, sharp focus on the two players in the left foreground.  I also love the position of the ball and the motion blur on it.  I''m not sure about the player bursting into the frame from the left.  It does add action, but I think I''d prefer it not to be there.  Without it, the composition would be perfectly balanced.', '2003-09-21 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(425016, 37783, 10867, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this photo has a number of quite serious flaws.  I''m also not sure why the heads seem to whited out.</td>', 'In my opinion, this photo has a number of quite serious flaws.  I''m also not sure why the heads seem to whited out.', '2003-09-21 14:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(425020, 37834, 10867, '<td valign="top">I love the positions of the boy and ball on the left.  The boy''s off the ground position shows action and is, besides, very graceful.  Very nice timing on this.  On the other hand, the positions of the Dad and the littlest kid are awkward, with the little one almost hidden by the Dad.  Two other problems:  the horizon is a bit tilted and the composition, with the large adult in the centre of the frame, is flawed, in my view.</td>', 'I love the positions of the boy and ball on the left.  The boy''s off the ground position shows action and is, besides, very graceful.  Very nice timing on this.  On the other hand, the positions of the Dad and the littlest kid are awkward, with the little one almost hidden by the Dad.  Two other problems:  the horizon is a bit tilted and the composition, with the large adult in the centre of the frame, is flawed, in my view.', '2003-09-21 14:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(425041, 37134, 10867, '<td valign="top">The combination of bright sun and haze must have made this a real challenge  to photograph.    The bright sun has created some hotspots on the "sail" and the mist haze has created some lack of clarity.  Also, it would have been better, I think, if the main subject hadn''t been quite so centred.</td>', 'The combination of bright sun and haze must have made this a real challenge  to photograph.    The bright sun has created some hotspots on the "sail" and the mist haze has created some lack of clarity.  Also, it would have been better, I think, if the main subject hadn''t been quite so centred.', '2003-09-21 16:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(425044, 37759, 10867, '<td valign="top">Chess a sport?  Well, it''s certainly a competitive activity, though I''m not sure if I''d call it a sport. The colours are generally good and the choice of perspective is interesting.  There a bit of a problem with unwanted reflections, especially in the lower left area.</td>', 'Chess a sport?  Well, it''s certainly a competitive activity, though I''m not sure if I''d call it a sport. The colours are generally good and the choice of perspective is interesting.  There a bit of a problem with unwanted reflections, especially in the lower left area.', '2003-09-21 16:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(425046, 37639, 10867, '<td valign="top">This photo is interesting (I love the expressions), but I''m afraid I can''t quite see how it qualifies as a sports image.</td>', 'This photo is interesting (I love the expressions), but I''m afraid I can''t quite see how it qualifies as a sports image.', '2003-09-21 16:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(425049, 37652, 10867, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and definitely a sports subject.  Good straight horizon, too.  I think I''d like the image to be a bit sharper and less hazy, but I guess that the weather was responsible for the haze, and there''s not too much we can do about the weather.</td>', 'Nice composition and definitely a sports subject.  Good straight horizon, too.  I think I''d like the image to be a bit sharper and less hazy, but I guess that the weather was responsible for the haze, and there''s not too much we can do about the weather.', '2003-09-21 16:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(425050, 37426, 10867, '<td valign="top">VEry nice choice of subject and great timing and composition.</td>', 'VEry nice choice of subject and great timing and composition.', '2003-09-21 16:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(425052, 37009, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very nice sports action shot.  Good colour.  I think that the centring works quite well here.</td>', 'Very nice sports action shot.  Good colour.  I think that the centring works quite well here.', '2003-09-21 16:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(425055, 37685, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is quite a daring shot.  We don''t often see a shot of a motorcycle racer with only a leg of the cyclist showing and with the cycle boxed into a very tight space.  The box is a little too tight for my taste, but I find the image quite effective in its own way.</td>', 'This is quite a daring shot.  We don''t often see a shot of a motorcycle racer with only a leg of the cyclist showing and with the cycle boxed into a very tight space.  The box is a little too tight for my taste, but I find the image quite effective in its own way.', '2003-09-21 16:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(425057, 37595, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty sunset shot, but while there is a small fishing boat present in the shot, the main emphasis is on the sunset and not on the boat.  Consequently, this doesn''t really seem much like a sports shot to me.  That''s just my opinion, of course.</td>', 'This is a pretty sunset shot, but while there is a small fishing boat present in the shot, the main emphasis is on the sunset and not on the boat.  Consequently, this doesn''t really seem much like a sports shot to me.  That''s just my opinion, of course.', '2003-09-21 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(425058, 37330, 10867, '<td valign="top">A very interesting chess shot.  I like the motion blur on the pawn in the middle of the row of pawns.  I personally don''t see chess as a sport, but I like this shot.  Nice sepia tones and interesting concept.</td>', 'A very interesting chess shot.  I like the motion blur on the pawn in the middle of the row of pawns.  I personally don''t see chess as a sport, but I like this shot.  Nice sepia tones and interesting concept.', '2003-09-21 16:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(425059, 37750, 10867, '<td valign="top">VEry good colour and composition and plenty of action.  It would have been nice to see a bit more of the dark haired player''s face, but that''s nit picking.</td>', 'VEry good colour and composition and plenty of action.  It would have been nice to see a bit more of the dark haired player''s face, but that''s nit picking.', '2003-09-21 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(425061, 37842, 10867, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2003-09-21 16:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(425063, 37558, 10867, '<td valign="top">Chess really does seem to be a sport in this shot--complete with gatorade and a towel!  There seems to be a bit of a colour cast in the photo and it would be nice if the image were a bit sharper, but I love the concept of this shot and the pose and expression of the "chess athlete"!  Small point:  there''s a bit too much negative space over the player''s head for my tast, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Chess really does seem to be a sport in this shot--complete with gatorade and a towel!  There seems to be a bit of a colour cast in the photo and it would be nice if the image were a bit sharper, but I love the concept of this shot and the pose and expression of the "chess athlete"!  Small point:  there''s a bit too much negative space over the player''s head for my tast, but that''s just me.', '2003-09-21 16:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(425064, 37289, 10867, '<td valign="top">Good action and colour.  The 1/2 man intruding into the frame at the top left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good action and colour.  The 1/2 man intruding into the frame at the top left is a bit distracting.', '2003-09-21 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(425067, 37508, 10867, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject and of POV.</td>', 'Good choice of subject and of POV.', '2003-09-21 16:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(425068, 37852, 10867, '<td valign="top">VEry interesting and original choice of subject and interesting use of light and space.  Nice colours and the border suits the subject well.</td>', 'VEry interesting and original choice of subject and interesting use of light and space.  Nice colours and the border suits the subject well.', '2003-09-21 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(425071, 37265, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I''d love to know how the blue "x-ray" effect was achieved.  It''s very effective.  An unusual and quite exciting boxing image.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I''d love to know how the blue "x-ray" effect was achieved.  It''s very effective.  An unusual and quite exciting boxing image.', '2003-09-21 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(425072, 37613, 10867, '<td valign="top">Nice action but a little too unclear to be fully effective, I feel.  I really like the composition, though.</td>', 'Nice action but a little too unclear to be fully effective, I feel.  I really like the composition, though.', '2003-09-21 16:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(425073, 37471, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lots of fun!  I like the colours and the motion blurs.  The lighting seems to have been a bit problematic, though.</td>', 'Lots of fun!  I like the colours and the motion blurs.  The lighting seems to have been a bit problematic, though.', '2003-09-21 16:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(425074, 37684, 10867, '<td valign="top">The reds are nice and rich.  Perhaps because of the horizontal lines, though, the image feels a bit static.</td>', 'The reds are nice and rich.  Perhaps because of the horizontal lines, though, the image feels a bit static.', '2003-09-21 16:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(425075, 37824, 10867, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp selective focus on the ball and good colours.  The border works well.  I think that I''d have liked the ball a little bit less centred.</td>', 'Nice sharp selective focus on the ball and good colours.  The border works well.  I think that I''d have liked the ball a little bit less centred.', '2003-09-21 16:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(425076, 37763, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very clever, fun and nicely composed.  I like the sharpness of the cactus (ouch!) and the rich greens and reds.  The white of the ball seems a bit blown out, though.</td>', 'Very clever, fun and nicely composed.  I like the sharpness of the cactus (ouch!) and the rich greens and reds.  The white of the ball seems a bit blown out, though.', '2003-09-21 16:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(425077, 37615, 10867, '<td valign="top">Good colourful, nicely timed action shot.  Great colours.</td>', 'Good colourful, nicely timed action shot.  Great colours.', '2003-09-21 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(425078, 37751, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image (I love the colours and textures), but I can''t quite see its connection with sports, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This is a lovely image (I love the colours and textures), but I can''t quite see its connection with sports, I''m afraid.', '2003-09-21 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(425080, 37238, 10867, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great choice of subject and perspective.  I like the lens flare, too!</td>', 'Wow!  Great choice of subject and perspective.  I like the lens flare, too!', '2003-09-21 16:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(425081, 37807, 10867, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and detail, excellent colours and tons of sports action!  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Great clarity and detail, excellent colours and tons of sports action!  Excellent shot!', '2003-09-21 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(425082, 37771, 10867, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition, but a bit too posed to be right for the assignment, in my opinion--which is, of course, just that.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition, but a bit too posed to be right for the assignment, in my opinion--which is, of course, just that.', '2003-09-21 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(425102, 37808, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this, it''s cute... Love that van behind the girl also :-)  It looks to me like you tried to sharpen this photo WAY too much?  Is that why it looks kind of jagged around all the edges, or it could have happened during compression.  I think I would have liked a faster shutter speed on this one to get stop action on the hand and ball, you might have achieved this by speeding up the iso, or since it''s outdoors and you didn''t have to worry about using a flash, one of those might have helped.  I like the reflections also in the van.</td>', 'I like this, it''s cute... Love that van behind the girl also :-)  It looks to me like you tried to sharpen this photo WAY too much?  Is that why it looks kind of jagged around all the edges, or it could have happened during compression.  I think I would have liked a faster shutter speed on this one to get stop action on the hand and ball, you might have achieved this by speeding up the iso, or since it''s outdoors and you didn''t have to worry about using a flash, one of those might have helped.  I like the reflections also in the van.', '2003-09-21 17:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(425103, 37655, 4967, '<td valign="top">It bothers me that the ball is just barely in the photo... I''m wondering if you cropped it this way on purpose or whether thats just how the shot was.  I think you could have taken a lot more shots to get that better.  I wish the club were already coming down rather than just up on his shoulder, giving the viewer more of a clue about what was going to happen.  I think you might have been able to fix a little of the white sky by using a polzarizing filter, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'It bothers me that the ball is just barely in the photo... I''m wondering if you cropped it this way on purpose or whether thats just how the shot was.  I think you could have taken a lot more shots to get that better.  I wish the club were already coming down rather than just up on his shoulder, giving the viewer more of a clue about what was going to happen.  I think you might have been able to fix a little of the white sky by using a polzarizing filter, but I''m not sure.', '2003-09-21 17:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(425104, 37807, 4967, '<td valign="top">Cool, nice job getting closer to the action.  I wish I could see more of the guys face, and that he was more at the peak of the action rather then being what looks at like the end of it.  I like the redness of his shorts which draws your eye to him rather then anything else.  I think cropping some off the top might have given it a little higher look because the water behind him looks flat.</td>', 'Cool, nice job getting closer to the action.  I wish I could see more of the guys face, and that he was more at the peak of the action rather then being what looks at like the end of it.  I like the redness of his shorts which draws your eye to him rather then anything else.  I think cropping some off the top might have given it a little higher look because the water behind him looks flat.', '2003-09-21 17:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(425105, 37289, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hehehe kiddie football always fun to watch and shoot.  This is cute, shows some fairly good action, might have been nice to see one of the guys in yellow a little closer but it''s not a big deal.  I think you could have cropped down almost to the top of the guy in yellow''s helmet, as well as some of the left to the farthest guys foot.  Nice job getting the ball in the photo.</td>', 'Hehehe kiddie football always fun to watch and shoot.  This is cute, shows some fairly good action, might have been nice to see one of the guys in yellow a little closer but it''s not a big deal.  I think you could have cropped down almost to the top of the guy in yellow''s helmet, as well as some of the left to the farthest guys foot.  Nice job getting the ball in the photo.', '2003-09-21 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(425106, 37200, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great panning shot.  Very nicely done, I like how its kind of going diagonally into the photo instead of just straight across.  I''m curious what the brownish thing is in the middle that comes to the top of the car?  Cropping some off the left might have made it a tad bit more visually interesting IMHO.  I also think the exposure could have been just slightly longer?  but I''m not sure on that one.  Nicely done though.</td>', 'Great panning shot.  Very nicely done, I like how its kind of going diagonally into the photo instead of just straight across.  I''m curious what the brownish thing is in the middle that comes to the top of the car?  Cropping some off the left might have made it a tad bit more visually interesting IMHO.  I also think the exposure could have been just slightly longer?  but I''m not sure on that one.  Nicely done though.', '2003-09-21 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(425107, 37007, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  I know you say you didn''t crop, but I think it might have been nice if you had cropped just a tiny bit off the top, not a big deal though.  Great look on the kids face, great action, might have been nice to have another player maybe coming up from behind to show it was during a game rather then just a game of catch or whatever, but thats ok.  I love the tattoo... adds to the "toughness" of the photo.  -9-</td>', 'Great catch!  I know you say you didn''t crop, but I think it might have been nice if you had cropped just a tiny bit off the top, not a big deal though.  Great look on the kids face, great action, might have been nice to have another player maybe coming up from behind to show it was during a game rather then just a game of catch or whatever, but thats ok.  I love the tattoo... adds to the "toughness" of the photo.  -9-', '2003-09-21 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(425109, 37790, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice job with your composition.  I don''t feel this is a really sporty idea photo though.  There is just not enough action for me to be interested in it.  Plus she is WAY too far away for me to feel close to the subject whatsoever.  I think sports photos are made their best either through action or through emotion or both.  Although I see what you were going for with the rule of thirds, I think this photo has WAY too much water in it.. and like half of it could have been cropped out.  Thats my two cents.</td>', 'Nice job with your composition.  I don''t feel this is a really sporty idea photo though.  There is just not enough action for me to be interested in it.  Plus she is WAY too far away for me to feel close to the subject whatsoever.  I think sports photos are made their best either through action or through emotion or both.  Although I see what you were going for with the rule of thirds, I think this photo has WAY too much water in it.. and like half of it could have been cropped out.  Thats my two cents.', '2003-09-21 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(425112, 37508, 4967, '<td valign="top">Wish we had a closer view of this.  I''m sure it was probably zoom liimitation on the camera.  Good action here though!  I think, depending on how many Megapixels your camer is, you proabably could have cropped quite a bit, to bring them more into view.  It looks like you could have waited til they were closer to you as well.  I would have cropped quite a bit here...</td>', 'Wish we had a closer view of this.  I''m sure it was probably zoom liimitation on the camera.  Good action here though!  I think, depending on how many Megapixels your camer is, you proabably could have cropped quite a bit, to bring them more into view.  It looks like you could have waited til they were closer to you as well.  I would have cropped quite a bit here...', '2003-09-21 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(425119, 36920, 4967, '<td valign="top">The two people in the photo make for a more interesting picture I think.  I would have liked it if they were more at the peak of the wave rather then the bottom but it\''s not too big of a deal.  Good action here... I might have cropped some off the top, but I kind of like it how you have it.</td>', 'The two people in the photo make for a more interesting picture I think.  I would have liked it if they were more at the peak of the wave rather then the bottom but it\''s not too big of a deal.  Good action here... I might have cropped some off the top, but I kind of like it how you have it.', '2003-09-21 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(425126, 37508, 9932, '<td valign="top">A little more cropping to cut out the annoying structure in the upper right and to concentrate on the horses and the rail would have made this a much more interesting photo I think. Still a nice vote.</td>', 'A little more cropping to cut out the annoying structure in the upper right and to concentrate on the horses and the rail would have made this a much more interesting photo I think. Still a nice vote.', '2003-09-21 18:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(425127, 37595, 9932, '<td valign="top">A get the feeling this is a fisherman coming in? It is a little dark to tell.</td>', 'A get the feeling this is a fisherman coming in? It is a little dark to tell.', '2003-09-21 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(425128, 37802, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Beautiful focus. Shows where the actions is. The ball almost looks like its floating in air. Great depth of field. The red uniformed player really stands out of the background even with the same color.</td>', 'Great action shot. Beautiful focus. Shows where the actions is. The ball almost looks like its floating in air. Great depth of field. The red uniformed player really stands out of the background even with the same color.', '2003-09-21 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(425129, 37736, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful action shot. Nice clear focus really brings your eyes to the windsurfer. Good focusing really makes him pop out of the shot. Great depth of field.</td>', 'Beautiful action shot. Nice clear focus really brings your eyes to the windsurfer. Good focusing really makes him pop out of the shot. Great depth of field.', '2003-09-21 18:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(425136, 37596, 2125, '<td valign="top">nice ''catch'' the dog and the photography good and crisp and great light!!<br/></td>', 'nice ''catch'' the dog and the photography good and crisp and great light!!', '2003-09-21 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(425137, 37802, 2125, '<td valign="top">great action shot that guy''s hair made me laugh</td>', 'great action shot that guy''s hair made me laugh', '2003-09-21 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(425139, 37495, 2125, '<td valign="top">very creative!! it looks like it was taken underwater 9</td>', 'very creative!! it looks like it was taken underwater 9', '2003-09-21 19:10:40.000000', NULL, 1);
