(425153, 37824, 2125, '<td valign="top">Tiger would be proud the only thing that bugs me is the tennis shoe or what looks like one..maybe just the head and ball without the foot... 9</td>', 'Tiger would be proud the only thing that bugs me is the tennis shoe or what looks like one..maybe just the head and ball without the foot... 9', '2003-09-21 19:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
