(425203, 37745, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the face and the composition. The blurred barrel of the gun from the DOF is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the expression on the face and the composition. The blurred barrel of the gun from the DOF is a little distracting.', '2003-09-21 20:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
