(425238, 37552, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping; it concentrates the action/subjects well.</td>', 'I like the cropping; it concentrates the action/subjects well.', '2003-09-21 21:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(425239, 37580, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the subject :-)  looks like a lot of fun.  I wish that the ball was closer to the guy, I can''t tell whether he just kicked it, or he''s going to catch it or what.  Also the fact that I can''t see the main guys face really bothers me.  I do like the guy on the left coming into the frame''s face.  I think the ball should have been closer to the subject, that would have helped making this a more interesting and better sports photo.  Great job with focus though, and at least you had the ball in the photo :-)</td>', 'I love the subject :-)  looks like a lot of fun.  I wish that the ball was closer to the guy, I can''t tell whether he just kicked it, or he''s going to catch it or what.  Also the fact that I can''t see the main guys face really bothers me.  I do like the guy on the left coming into the frame''s face.  I think the ball should have been closer to the subject, that would have helped making this a more interesting and better sports photo.  Great job with focus though, and at least you had the ball in the photo :-)', '2003-09-21 21:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(425240, 37265, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting if eerie effect!</td>', 'Interesting if eerie effect!', '2003-09-21 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(425241, 37697, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing your title refers to guys eating/watching in the background.<br/>In the game itself, 3 against 1 doesn''t seem fair ...</td>', 'I''m guessing your title refers to guys eating/watching in the background.In the game itself, 3 against 1 doesn''t seem fair ...', '2003-09-21 21:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(425242, 37771, 4967, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here though... but I really am trying to go a little bit with the "action" part of the directions.  He''s scrubbing the board right... while this is a part of the sport, it''s not the sport itself, the sport isn''t in cleaning the board, it''s in riding it, thats just my interpretation anyway.  Is he really sunburnt, or is there too much red in the shot hehehe... hard to know.  I wish we could see his face, and maybe his concentration on the task at hand.</td>', 'I see what you were going for here though... but I really am trying to go a little bit with the "action" part of the directions.  He''s scrubbing the board right... while this is a part of the sport, it''s not the sport itself, the sport isn''t in cleaning the board, it''s in riding it, thats just my interpretation anyway.  Is he really sunburnt, or is there too much red in the shot hehehe... hard to know.  I wish we could see his face, and maybe his concentration on the task at hand.', '2003-09-21 21:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
