(425251, 37763, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d RATHER take that out with a club anyway! Those look ripe though; if you use a wedge you might be able to slice them at the same time as the ball and enjoy a snack.</td>', 'I''d RATHER take that out with a club anyway! Those look ripe though; if you use a wedge you might be able to slice them at the same time as the ball and enjoy a snack.', '2003-09-21 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
