(425254, 37563, 6325, '<td valign="top">Really captures the action.</td>', 'Really captures the action.', '2003-09-21 21:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(425255, 37807, 11073, '<td valign="top">nice action shot - i like the timing of his move so that he''s facing down.  I don''t see alot of surf shots...but I don''t remember seeing one with the surfer "posed" like that - kudos for originality imo.</td>', 'nice action shot - i like the timing of his move so that he''s facing down.  I don''t see alot of surf shots...but I don''t remember seeing one with the surfer "posed" like that - kudos for originality imo.', '2003-09-21 21:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
