(425257, 37715, 1031, '<td valign="top">So, did the goalie get it or not? He looks a bit late. I''d have cropped some of the foreground, just below where the darker grass starts.</td>', 'So, did the goalie get it or not? He looks a bit late. I''d have cropped some of the foreground, just below where the darker grass starts.', '2003-09-21 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(425258, 37825, 11073, '<td valign="top">very good shot. I like the blurred spectator saying something to the rider.  adds more emotion to his already "emotional" pose of putting the head down and digging deap. the iso noise is there but it''s not too bad, actually makes the spectators look cool imo.  nice work.</td>', 'very good shot. I like the blurred spectator saying something to the rider.  adds more emotion to his already "emotional" pose of putting the head down and digging deap. the iso noise is there but it''s not too bad, actually makes the spectators look cool imo.  nice work.', '2003-09-21 22:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(425259, 37787, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overexposed, and the lighting a little harsh.</td>', 'Looks a little overexposed, and the lighting a little harsh.', '2003-09-21 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(425260, 37745, 1031, '<td valign="top">If that''s one of those guns that shoots paint balls, I''ve been curious as to how much they cost. Looks like something from Star Wars though ...</td>', 'If that''s one of those guns that shoots paint balls, I''ve been curious as to how much they cost. Looks like something from Star Wars though ...', '2003-09-21 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
