(425279, 37829, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, I think it''s very cool... I know that this is how the guy is always so it doesn''t really show action, but the way you shot it really works... :-)  I think it is much more effective then had you shot it straight on... it almost seems like we''re thinking what to do... I can''t give it top marks because truthfully it''s not completely your shot, it''s someone elses art work, but I still think its a cool photo -8-</td>', 'I like this a lot, I think it''s very cool... I know that this is how the guy is always so it doesn''t really show action, but the way you shot it really works... :-)  I think it is much more effective then had you shot it straight on... it almost seems like we''re thinking what to do... I can''t give it top marks because truthfully it''s not completely your shot, it''s someone elses art work, but I still think its a cool photo -8-', '2003-09-21 22:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(425281, 37751, 4967, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t really strike me as sporty, although it''s sports related, there is definitely no action, and it just isn''t saying, hey lets go play or whatever.... I like the red with the black stripes on the sides though.</td>', 'This picture doesn''t really strike me as sporty, although it''s sports related, there is definitely no action, and it just isn''t saying, hey lets go play or whatever.... I like the red with the black stripes on the sides though.', '2003-09-21 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(425282, 37652, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very cool... what is he flying from?  I wish we could see him closer, and maybe see his face.  I think the intense look on his face would be really cool.  I think it''s just too far away for it to be really effective.  Also I think I would have cropped it differently, but I''m not sure how I would have cropped it.</td>', 'Very cool... what is he flying from?  I wish we could see him closer, and maybe see his face.  I think the intense look on his face would be really cool.  I think it''s just too far away for it to be really effective.  Also I think I would have cropped it differently, but I''m not sure how I would have cropped it.', '2003-09-21 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(425283, 37710, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... great DOF... to show all the people and in focus.  I also like your crop, a lot of people would have left more of the top in, but I like what you did here... Good action here with the racers... only thing I might say is maybe getting a little closer and specifying one of them as your main racer... especially would have been nice to see some more intense looks on their faces.. still a nice solid, if not extremely interesting... but good sports shot... -8-</td>', 'I like this a lot... great DOF... to show all the people and in focus.  I also like your crop, a lot of people would have left more of the top in, but I like what you did here... Good action here with the racers... only thing I might say is maybe getting a little closer and specifying one of them as your main racer... especially would have been nice to see some more intense looks on their faces.. still a nice solid, if not extremely interesting... but good sports shot... -8-', '2003-09-21 22:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(425284, 37750, 4967, '<td valign="top">I wish the ball was closer to the player... I do like the fact the ball is in the photo... and great focus and clarity.  I also wish we could see a little more of the players face, and maybe the number 6 guy running towards the ball although I suppose then you couldn''t have used your title :-)  Good action here... not extremely interesting... but solid and well done.  -7-</td>', 'I wish the ball was closer to the player... I do like the fact the ball is in the photo... and great focus and clarity.  I also wish we could see a little more of the players face, and maybe the number 6 guy running towards the ball although I suppose then you couldn''t have used your title :-)  Good action here... not extremely interesting... but solid and well done.  -7-', '2003-09-21 22:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(425285, 37426, 4967, '<td valign="top">Good composition here... nice job getting that ball right on the edge as its dropping in.  Is this on a real golf course, or did you do it at a mini golf place where you could take the shot over and over again?  :-)  Good job with your hole in one ;-)  although I''m guessing it''s not yours if you were taking the picture... hehehe anyway... not extremely interesting, but a good catch.</td>', 'Good composition here... nice job getting that ball right on the edge as its dropping in.  Is this on a real golf course, or did you do it at a mini golf place where you could take the shot over and over again?  :-)  Good job with your hole in one ;-)  although I''m guessing it''s not yours if you were taking the picture... hehehe anyway... not extremely interesting, but a good catch.', '2003-09-21 22:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(425286, 37759, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any action here, I have no problem with chess being a sport, but having no action happening bothers me, and I don''t feel that it really makes it in the challenge.  I like your composition though and the fact you didn''t just shoot it straight on you put it diagonally into the shot.</td>', 'I don''t see any action here, I have no problem with chess being a sport, but having no action happening bothers me, and I don''t feel that it really makes it in the challenge.  I like your composition though and the fact you didn''t just shoot it straight on you put it diagonally into the shot.', '2003-09-21 22:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(425287, 37810, 4967, '<td valign="top">Amusing... I guess there is action, but I don''t really count this as a sport, but I guess it''s in the eye of the beholder.  I"m quite amused that the coach potato is concerned with drinking Diet, caffeine free coke.  Hehehe... but it''s a nicely done shot... a little noisy, but it''s not a big deal.</td>', 'Amusing... I guess there is action, but I don''t really count this as a sport, but I guess it''s in the eye of the beholder.  I"m quite amused that the coach potato is concerned with drinking Diet, caffeine free coke.  Hehehe... but it''s a nicely done shot... a little noisy, but it''s not a big deal.', '2003-09-21 22:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(425288, 37685, 4967, '<td valign="top">It really bother me that you cut off the guys head.  I think also that the bike isn''t quite in focus, or maybe it is and there is a lot of dust... I think your cropping her, in camera or out of just wasn''t effective.  Sorry...</td>', 'It really bother me that you cut off the guys head.  I think also that the bike isn''t quite in focus, or maybe it is and there is a lot of dust... I think your cropping her, in camera or out of just wasn''t effective.  Sorry...', '2003-09-21 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(425289, 37595, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, wish there was a little action though maybe could have been last thrill of the day, but I think this was about the action.  I do like the waves breaking though and his walking out... also would hope to have him more in the rule of thirds... but it''s a a very pretty romantic sports shot :-)</td>', 'Very pretty, wish there was a little action though maybe could have been last thrill of the day, but I think this was about the action.  I do like the waves breaking though and his walking out... also would hope to have him more in the rule of thirds... but it''s a a very pretty romantic sports shot :-)', '2003-09-21 22:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(425290, 37787, 3247, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but where''s the action?  Good focus and lighting..  could have easily gotten a 9 with some action.</td>', 'Good photo, but where''s the action?  Good focus and lighting..  could have easily gotten a 9 with some action.', '2003-09-21 22:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(425291, 37552, 4967, '<td valign="top">Did he get it?  I wish we could see him closer, or see his face, although I''m sure there were zoom limitations.  Good action here, that ump and the catcher are definitely ready.  Good catch with the ball in there... The  colors look a little oversaturated... I think you might have been able to crop in even more severely from the right and the bottom, to get more of an extreme look.  But not too bad :-)  <br/></td>', 'Did he get it?  I wish we could see him closer, or see his face, although I''m sure there were zoom limitations.  Good action here, that ump and the catcher are definitely ready.  Good catch with the ball in there... The  colors look a little oversaturated... I think you might have been able to crop in even more severely from the right and the bottom, to get more of an extreme look.  But not too bad :-)  ', '2003-09-21 22:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(425292, 37710, 3247, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but seems a little dark.</td>', 'Nice composition, but seems a little dark.', '2003-09-21 22:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(425293, 37834, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great action shot of that kid!  Too bad he''s not coming towards you and you can''t see his face.  Wonderful catch though... Personally I don''t think that the kid on the right needed to be in the photo, and I think you could have cropped substantially from the top, the bottom, and the right.  I''m not keen on your title... but hey it''s not a big deal to me... I just wish we could see that boy!</td>', 'Great action shot of that kid!  Too bad he''s not coming towards you and you can''t see his face.  Wonderful catch though... Personally I don''t think that the kid on the right needed to be in the photo, and I think you could have cropped substantially from the top, the bottom, and the right.  I''m not keen on your title... but hey it''s not a big deal to me... I just wish we could see that boy!', '2003-09-21 22:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(425294, 37615, 4967, '<td valign="top">I wish we were focused more on the guy with the ball, but I do like your repetitiveness and the action happening here.  It really bothers me that the kid with the ball is running out of the photo because 1) it takes my eyes right off the page and 2) he supposed to go the other way and while I know that he''s just passing it off, not everyone does and it could be confusing.  Great action here though, I think next time try to zoom in on the person with the ball just my 2 cents.</td>', 'I wish we were focused more on the guy with the ball, but I do like your repetitiveness and the action happening here.  It really bothers me that the kid with the ball is running out of the photo because 1) it takes my eyes right off the page and 2) he supposed to go the other way and while I know that he''s just passing it off, not everyone does and it could be confusing.  Great action here though, I think next time try to zoom in on the person with the ball just my 2 cents.', '2003-09-21 22:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(425295, 37655, 3247, '<td valign="top">Photo is a bit under exposed. Maybe try to get the bal a bit more into the picture.  Leads the eye off the side a bit.</td>', 'Photo is a bit under exposed. Maybe try to get the bal a bit more into the picture.  Leads the eye off the side a bit.', '2003-09-21 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(425296, 37495, 4967, '<td valign="top">Did you use a flash?  Or what are thos ebright spots on the photo... I wish we could see more action like the water moving or something, it kind of just looks like their holding the guy just in the water.  He''s hooked pretty well.  The hand bothers me a lot, because there is just too much light on it.</td>', 'Did you use a flash?  Or what are thos ebright spots on the photo... I wish we could see more action like the water moving or something, it kind of just looks like their holding the guy just in the water.  He''s hooked pretty well.  The hand bothers me a lot, because there is just too much light on it.', '2003-09-21 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(425297, 37007, 8159, '<td valign="top">If only you had caught this shot a few hundred milliseconds earlier, it would have been perfect! The ball a few inches above his fingers would have given this a much more realistic look, since in my opinion it does look this could be "posed". Great clarity and DOF though!</td>', 'If only you had caught this shot a few hundred milliseconds earlier, it would have been perfect! The ball a few inches above his fingers would have given this a much more realistic look, since in my opinion it does look this could be "posed". Great clarity and DOF though!', '2003-09-21 23:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(425301, 37685, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think that i would score higher if I could see the rider.  if it was just a bike composition it would be fine...but because it looks like a race situation my "minds eye" can''t get over the fact that something is missing - the rider.  just my two cents.  that said -  i like the fact that you filled the frame with the bike, and the lighting is good.</td>', 'i think that i would score higher if I could see the rider.  if it was just a bike composition it would be fine...but because it looks like a race situation my "minds eye" can''t get over the fact that something is missing - the rider.  just my two cents.  that said -  i like the fact that you filled the frame with the bike, and the lighting is good.', '2003-09-21 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(425303, 37759, 11073, '<td valign="top">the focus seems to be out across the whole picture.</td>', 'the focus seems to be out across the whole picture.', '2003-09-21 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
