(425322, 37330, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I''m sure tons of people have said this isn''t a sport, but i''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I''m sure tons of people have said this isn''t a sport, but i''m giving it a 10.', '2003-09-22 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
