(425331, 37648, 8159, '<td valign="top">The DOF really makes this shot "pop". There is also a slight amount of motion blur in the arms, which adds to the "action"-ness of this shot. The overcast weather really helped out, since it probably prevented a harsh shadow from being cast on the face from the helmet. Great job!</td>', 'The DOF really makes this shot "pop". There is also a slight amount of motion blur in the arms, which adds to the "action"-ness of this shot. The overcast weather really helped out, since it probably prevented a harsh shadow from being cast on the face from the helmet. Great job!', '2003-09-22 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
