(426754, 37568, 11155, '<td valign="top">Well, this was my first entry in a contest.  I''m glad it did relatively well, and I''m glad to have received some very helpful comments.  Thanks to all who voted and especially to those who commented.</td>', 'Well, this was my first entry in a contest.  I''m glad it did relatively well, and I''m glad to have received some very helpful comments.  Thanks to all who voted and especially to those who commented.', '2003-09-22 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(426907, 37842, 1845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Spazmo99:</b></div><hr/><i><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwoolridge:</b></div><hr/><i>as i suspected. pointless.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What happened to your "...is seen to be artifice..." comment?? I was rather fond of it.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If images are but a bulk commodity to be quantified, ordered, and barely glimpsed, then what of the words said unto them?  Attach to them no significance and give them no permanence, but let them remain ephemeral, false, and vague, as memory.</td>', 'Originally posted by Spazmo99:Originally posted by dwoolridge:as i suspected. pointless.  What happened to your "...is seen to be artifice..." comment?? I was rather fond of it.  If images are but a bulk commodity to be quantified, ordered, and barely glimpsed, then what of the words said unto them?  Attach to them no significance and give them no permanence, but let them remain ephemeral, false, and vague, as memory.', '2003-09-23 02:08:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(426940, 37807, 6870, '<td valign="top">When I lived in so. CA, I went surfing a lot. THis shot makes me homesick! Nice, dramatic photo.</td>', 'When I lived in so. CA, I went surfing a lot. THis shot makes me homesick! Nice, dramatic photo.', '2003-09-23 03:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(426946, 37007, 9251, '<td valign="top">Hi, Your shot is very good..I can tell it is real by the expression on his face and the flex of his muscles..the title should have been left alone. Screen Pass was good. Nice work..shot of a life time.</td>', 'Hi, Your shot is very good..I can tell it is real by the expression on his face and the flex of his muscles..the title should have been left alone. Screen Pass was good. Nice work..shot of a life time.', '2003-09-23 03:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(427024, 37842, 10686, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwoolridge:</b></div><hr/><i><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Spazmo99:</b></div><hr/><i><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwoolridge:</b></div><hr/><i>as i suspected. pointless.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What happened to your "...is seen to be artifice..." comment?? I was rather fond of it.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If images are but a bulk commodity to be quantified, ordered, and barely glimpsed, then what of the words said unto them?  Attach to them no significance and give them no permanence, but let them remain ephemeral, false, and vague, as memory.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your reply, your words make an interesting point. So I have preserved them here in this message in case you again feel the need to make them disappear.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-23 08:40:11.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by dwoolridge:Originally posted by Spazmo99:Originally posted by dwoolridge:as i suspected. pointless.  What happened to your "...is seen to be artifice..." comment?? I was rather fond of it.  If images are but a bulk commodity to be quantified, ordered, and barely glimpsed, then what of the words said unto them?  Attach to them no significance and give them no permanence, but let them remain ephemeral, false, and vague, as memory.  Thanks for your reply, your words make an interesting point. So I have preserved them here in this message in case you again feel the need to make them disappear.', '2003-09-23 09:23:34.000000', '2003-09-23 09:40:11.000000', 0),
