(429286, 37568, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ten13:</b></div><hr/><i>Well, this was my first entry in a contest.  I''m glad it did relatively well...</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Top 20? Relatively well, I guess! Congratulations ... although I personally gave you a good score, I saw so much ranting about what was/wasn''t a "sport" I thought pocket billiards would miss the cut ....</td>', 'Originally posted by Ten13:Well, this was my first entry in a contest.  I''m glad it did relatively well... Top 20? Relatively well, I guess! Congratulations ... although I personally gave you a good score, I saw so much ranting about what was/wasn''t a "sport" I thought pocket billiards would miss the cut ....', '2003-09-24 19:51:33.000000', NULL, 0),
